eme.colorScheme.primary)\n                    Text(stringResource(R.string.app_name), Modifier.weight(1f),\n                        style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium, fontWeight = FontWeight.Bold,\n                        color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.onBackground)\n                }\n            }\n        }) { padding ->\n            Box(Modifier.fillMaxSize().padding(padding).consumeWindowInsets(padding).imePadding(),\n                contentAlignment = Alignment.TopCenter) { content() }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass ChartScreenTest {\n    @get:Rule val compose = createComposeRule()\n    private val context = InstrumentationRegistry.getInstrumentation().targetContext\n\n    @Test fun calculatedAspectsAndAngelsHaveAccessibleDetailsAndContextualHelp() {\n        val payload = chartFixture()\n        val natal = NatalAnalysis.calculate(payload.chart)\n        val angels = AngelicAnalysis.calculate(payload.chart)\n        assertTrue(natal.aspects.isNotEmpty())\n        compose.setContent { ChartCaptureSurface { ChartScreen(payload, {}, {}) } }\n        selectReading(\"natal-aspects\")\n        for (aspect in listOf(natal.aspects.first(), natal.aspects.last())) {\n=== AnalysisDocumentContentTest: montagem (30-95)\nimport dev.lcv.astrologo.ui.AstrologoTheme\nimport org.junit.Assert.*\nimport org.junit.Rule\nimport org.junit.Test\nimport org.junit.runner.RunWith\nimport org.junit.runners.Parameterized\nimport java.io.File\n\n/** Synthetic validated content in a native Compose host: no claim of paid purchase or delivered analysis. */\n@RunWith(Parameterized::class)\nclass AnalysisDocumentContentTest(private val width: Int, private val height: Int, private val scale: Float, private val dark: Boolean) {\n    @get:Rule val compose = createComposeRule()\n\n    private val paragraph = AnalysisRichText(listOf(\n        AnalysisTextRun(\"O céu inspira \"), AnalysisTextRun(\"autoconhecimento\", AnalysisEmphasis.STRONG),\n        AnalysisTextRun(\" e reflexão\", AnalysisEmphasis.EMPHASIS),\n        AnalysisTextRun(\" responsável.\", AnalysisEmphasis.STRONG_EMPHASIS),\n        AnalysisTextRun(\"\\nOutra perspectiva: coração, ação, 🌙, Ω e <b>texto literal</b>.\"),\n    ))\n    private val fullParagraph get() = paragraph.runs.joinToString(\"\") { it.text }\n    private val longParagraph = (1..90).joinToString(\"\\n\") { \"Perspectiva $it: observe seus hábitos com calma e considere diferentes possibilidades, sem tratar esta reflexão como uma certeza.\" }\n\n    private fun show(long: Boolean = false) {\n        val contract = AnalysisDocumentContract(documentId = \"native-presentation-fixture\", rootInputHash = \"a\".repeat(64),\n            promptVersion = \"fixture-only\", title = \"Seu Mapa em Perspectiva\", sections = listOf(\n                ExpectedAnalysisSection(\"first\", \"Autoconhecimento\", listOf(\"f0\"), AnalysisSectionStyle.HIGHLIGHT, AnalysisIcon.MOON),\n                ExpectedAnalysisSection(\"last\", \"Síntese e Reflexão\", listOf(\"f1\"), AnalysisSectionStyle.SYNTHESIS, AnalysisIcon.STARS),\n            ))\n        fun text(value: String) = AnalysisRichText(listOf(AnalysisTextRun(value)))\n        val first = if (long) listOf(AnalysisDocumentBlock.Paragraph(text(longParagraph), listOf(\"f0\"))) else listOf(\n            AnalysisDocumentBlock.Paragraph(paragraph, listOf(\"f0\")),\n            AnalysisDocumentBlock.ListBlock(listOf(AnalysisListItem(text(\"Reconheça seus ritmos.\"), listOf(\"f0\")),\n                AnalysisListItem(text(\"Reserve um tempo para si.\"), listOf(\"f0\"))), ordered = true),\n            AnalysisDocumentBlock.Callout(text(\"Você decide quais reflexões fazem sentido para sua vida.\"), listOf(\"f0\"),\n                AnalysisCalloutStyle.REFLECTION, AnalysisIcon.ROSE),\n            AnalysisDocumentBlock.Table(text(\"Um Olhar Sobre Seus Hábitos\"), listOf(text(\"Tema\"), text(\"Possibilidade\"), text(\"Reflexão\")),\n                (0..24).map { i -> AnalysisTableRow(listOf(text(\"Tema $i\"), text(\"Possibilidade $i\"), text(\"Reflexão completa $i — ação e equilíbrio 🌙\")), listOf(\"f0\")) }),\n        )\n        val document = AnalysisDocument(contractHash = contract.hash, sections = listOf(\n            AnalysisDocumentSection(\"first\", first),\n            AnalysisDocumentSection(\"last\", listOf(AnalysisDocumentBlock.Paragraph(text(\"Fim integral da análise: suas escolhas continuam sendo suas.\"), listOf(\"f1\")))),\n        ))\n        val validated = AnalysisDocumentValidator.validate(document, contract)\n        compose.setContent {\n            DeviceConfigurationOverride(DeviceConfigurationOverride.DarkMode(dark) then\n                DeviceConfigurationOverride.FontScale(scale) then\n                DeviceConfigurationOverride.ForcedSize(DpSize(width.dp, height.dp))) {\n                AstrologoTheme { AnalysisDocumentContent(validated) }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private fun reveal(tag: String) = compose.onNodeWithTag(\"analysis-document\").performScrollToNode(hasTestTag(tag))\n    private fun layout(tag: String): TextLayoutResult {\n        val result = mutableListOf<TextLayoutResult>()\n        compose.onNodeWithTag(tag).performSemanticsAction(SemanticsActions.GetTextLayoutResult) { it(result) }\n        return result.single()\n    }\n\n    private fun capture(stage: String) {\n        compose.waitForIdle()\n        val instrumentation = InstrumentationRegistry.getInstrumentation()\n        val screenshot = requireNotNull(instrumentation.uiAutomation.takeScreenshot())\n        try {\n            File(requireNotNull(instrumentation.targetContext.getExternalFilesDir(\"analysis-ui-proof\")),\n                \"synthetic-analysis-$stage-${width}x$height-$scale-$dark.png\").outputStream().use { assertTrue(screenshot.compress(Bitmap.CompressFormat.PNG, 100, it)) }\n=== ChartElementReadingTest 31-60\nclass ChartElementReadingTest {\n    @get:Rule val compose = createComposeRule()\n    private val context = InstrumentationRegistry.getInstrumentation().targetContext\n\n    @Test fun libraryIsAvailableWithoutPaidCallbacksAndPreservesHebrewDirection() {\n        val library = ChartElementLibrary.load(context)\n        compose.setContent { AstrologoTheme { ChartElementLibraryDialog(library, {}) } }\n        compose.onNodeWithTag(\"element-index-angel:1\").performScrollTo().performClick()\n        compose.onNodeWithTag(\"element-hebrew-angel:1\", useUnmergedTree = true).performScrollTo()\n            .assertTextEquals(AngelCatalog.entries.first().tripletHebrewPoster)\n        val layouts = mutableListOf<TextLayoutResult>()\n        compose.onNodeWithTag(\"element-hebrew-angel:1\", useUnmergedTree = true)\n            .performSemanticsAction(SemanticsActions.GetTextLayoutResult) { it(layouts) }\n        assertEquals(TextDirection.Rtl, layouts.single().layoutInput.style.textDirection)\n        capture(\"angel-1-hebrew\")\n        compose.onNodeWithTag(\"element-paragraph-angel:1-0-0\", useUnmergedTree = true)\n            .performSemanticsAction(SemanticsActions.GetTextLayoutResult) { it(layouts) }\n        assertEquals(TextDirection.Ltr, layouts.last().layoutInput.style.textDirection)\n        assertEquals(\"pt\", layouts.last().layoutInput.style.localeList!![0].language)\n        compose.onNodeWithTag(\"chart-detail-close\").assertIsDisplayed()\n        compose.onNodeWithTag(\"element-paragraph-angel:1-1-0\", useUnmergedTree = true).performScrollTo()\n        capture(\"angel-1-reflection\")\n        compose.onNodeWithTag(\"element-library-index\").performScrollTo().performClick()\n        compose.onNodeWithTag(\"element-index-planet:PLUTO\").performScrollTo().performClick()\n        compose.onNodeWithTag(\"element-library-free\").assertIsDisplayed()\n        capture(\"pluto-introduction\")\n    }\n\n    @Test fun everyRecordedElementResolvesByTheSameIdentityInBothInterfaceLanguages() {\n        val old = chartFixture()","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"01c6a1fc-2b06-4f39-a25d-9e8a3e86899d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glistening-tumbling-prism"}
