{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","hash":"14324b0ef3d6ca5eb04ff0822afb2b24f60f4336a6a21baf43245f97e256194e","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Preciso, em particular, do `MainActivity`, do construtor real do `BirthProfileViewModel`, das `testTag` da tela inicial e dos botões de mapa, trânsitos, sinastria, localidade e biblioteca, além de um emulador em pt-BR. Peço tudo isso agora, pois os três itens são independentes entre si.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EzA2y3bZvQX9Db6cyATcxA","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers && echo \"=== MainActivity\" && sed -n '1,200p' app/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/MainActivity.kt | grep -v '^import' | head -120; echo \"=== BirthProfileViewModel construtor\" && rg -n 'class BirthProfileViewModel' -A 8 app/src/main/kotlin | head -14","description":"Lê a atividade principal e o construtor do modelo da tela inicial para dirigir o app real na instrumentação"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017trBSaXznqCrMnG88ioNLp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers && echo \"=== testTags em AstrologoApp.kt\" && rg -o 'testTag\\(\"[^\"]+\"\\)' app/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/ui/AstrologoApp.kt | sort -u | head -60; echo \"=== testTags nas telas de transito/sinastria/localidade/paid (contagem)\" && for f in ui/transit/TransitScreen.kt ui/synastry/SynastryScreen.kt ui/locality/LocalityScreen.kt ui/paid/PaidAnalysisScreen.kt ui/chart/ChartScreen.kt ui/chart/ChartElementReading.kt; do echo \"-- $f: $(rg -o 'testTag\\(\"[^\"]+\"\\)' app/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/$f | sort -u | sed 's/testTag(//; s/)//' | tr '\\n' ' ' | cut -c1-600)\"; done","description":"Lista as marcas de teste da tela inicial e das telas principais para dirigir a interface"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SazLYGH2t1JgoPVn1Bo4S4","name":"PowerShell","input":{"command":"$adb = \"$env:LOCALAPPDATA\\Android\\Sdk\\platform-tools\\adb.exe\"; & $adb shell \"setprop persist.sys.locale pt-BR; setprop ctl.restart zygote\"; Start-Sleep -Seconds 25; $deadline=(Get-Date).AddMinutes(2); do { Start-Sleep -Seconds 5; $b = (& $adb shell getprop sys.boot_completed 2>$null) } while ($b -ne '1' -and (Get-Date) -lt $deadline); \"boot=$b locale=$(& $adb shell getprop persist.sys.locale) size=$(& $adb shell wm size) density=$(& $adb shell wm density)\"; & $adb shell settings put global window_animation_scale 0; & $adb shell settings put global transition_animation_scale 0; & $adb shell settings put global animator_duration_scale 0; & $adb shell settings put system screen_brightness 255; & $adb shell settings put global stay_on_while_plugged_in 7; \"animacoes desligadas\"","description":"Põe o emulador em pt-BR, reinicia o framework, reconfirma tela 1080x1920 e desliga animações para capturas estáveis","timeout":240000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","hash":"6d2c2af49f9aafc8c31000472527b31ac8a8e7f7669023890b6cd43a046e13e4","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EzA2y3bZvQX9Db6cyATcxA","type":"tool_result","content":"=== MainActivity\n/* Copyright © 2026 LCV Ideas & Software — SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-LCV-Ideas-And-Software-Proprietary */\npackage dev.lcv.astrologo\n\n\nclass MainActivity : ComponentActivity() {\n    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {\n        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)\n        enableEdgeToEdge()\n        setContent {\n            AstrologoTheme {\n                val model: BirthProfileViewModel = viewModel()\n                val charts: ChartViewModel = viewModel()\n                val exportChart = rememberChartPdfExportActions()\n                val analyses: SavedAnalysisViewModel = viewModel()\n                val paid: PaidFlowViewModel = viewModel()\n                val transits: TransitViewModel = viewModel { TransitViewModel(application, createSavedStateHandle()) }\n                val synastry: SynastryViewModel = viewModel()\n                val localities: LocalityViewModel = viewModel { LocalityViewModel(application, createSavedStateHandle()) }\n                AstrologoApp(model, charts, onExportChart = exportChart.chart,\n                    analysisModel = analyses, onExportAnalysis = exportChart.withAnalysis, paidModel = paid,\n                    transitModel = transits, synastryModel = synastry, onExportTransit = exportChart.withTransit,\n                    onExportSynastry = exportChart.withSynastry, localityModel = localities,\n                    onExportLocality = exportChart.withLocality)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n=== BirthProfileViewModel construtor\napp/src/main/kotlin\\dev\\lcv\\astrologo\\data\\BirthProfileViewModel.kt:24:class BirthProfileViewModel internal constructor(\napp/src/main/kotlin\\dev\\lcv\\astrologo\\data\\BirthProfileViewModel.kt-25-    application: Application,\napp/src/main/kotlin\\dev\\lcv\\astrologo\\data\\BirthProfileViewModel.kt-26-    private val daoFactory: () -> BirthProfileDao,\napp/src/main/kotlin\\dev\\lcv\\astrologo\\data\\BirthProfileViewModel.kt-27-    private val deleteProfile: (suspend (String) -> Unit)?,\napp/src/main/kotlin\\dev\\lcv\\astrologo\\data\\BirthProfileViewModel.kt-28-) : AndroidViewModel(application) {\napp/src/main/kotlin\\dev\\lcv\\astrologo\\data\\BirthProfileViewModel.kt-29-    internal constructor(application: Application, daoFactory: () -> BirthProfileDao) :\napp/src/main/kotlin\\dev\\lcv\\astrologo\\data\\BirthProfileViewModel.kt-30-        this(application, daoFactory, null)\napp/src/main/kotlin\\dev\\lcv\\astrologo\\data\\BirthProfileViewModel.kt-31-    constructor(application: Application) : this(application, { BirthDatabase.get(application).profiles() },\napp/src/main/kotlin\\dev\\lcv\\astrologo\\data\\BirthProfileViewModel.kt-32-        { id -> BirthDatabase.get(application).profileDeletion().deleteProfile(id) })","is_error":false},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017trBSaXznqCrMnG88ioNLp","type":"tool_result","content":"=== testTags em AstrologoApp.kt\ntestTag(\"about-link-error\")\ntestTag(\"about-privacy\")\ntestTag(\"about-security\")\ntestTag(\"about-terms\")\ntestTag(\"app-content\")\ntestTag(\"app-version\")\ntestTag(\"application-license\")\ntestTag(\"brand-header\")\ntestTag(\"calculate-${profile.id}\")\ntestTag(\"chart-history\")\ntestTag(\"chart-history-back\")\ntestTag(\"chart-history-empty\")\ntestTag(\"chart-history-loading\")\ntestTag(\"chart-history-read-failure\")\ntestTag(\"chart-work\")\ntestTag(\"chart-work-back\")\ntestTag(\"confirm-delete\")\ntestTag(\"delete-${profile.id}\")\ntestTag(\"edit-${profile.id}\")\ntestTag(\"general-contact\")\ntestTag(\"google-billing-notices\")\ntestTag(\"legal-back\")\ntestTag(\"legal-text\")\ntestTag(\"loading\")\ntestTag(\"location-data-attribution\")\ntestTag(\"new-profile\")\ntestTag(\"open-account-library\")\ntestTag(\"open-chart-${item.id}\")\ntestTag(\"open-chart-history\")\ntestTag(\"open-legal\")\ntestTag(\"profile-${profile.id}\")\ntestTag(\"profiles\")\ntestTag(\"read-failure\")\ntestTag(\"retry-chart-history\")\ntestTag(\"retry-read\")\ntestTag(\"saved-chart-${item.id}\")\ntestTag(\"saved-notice\")\n=== testTags nas telas de transito/sinastria/localidade/paid (contagem)\n-- ui/transit/TransitScreen.kt: \"transit-${row.id}\" \"transit-busy\" \"transit-calculate\" \"transit-date\" \"transit-error\" \"transit-export-pdf\" \"transit-history-${run.id}\" \"transit-horizon\" \"transit-now\" \"transit-paid-analysis\" \"transit-screen\" \"transit-time\" \n-- ui/synastry/SynastryScreen.kt: \"synastry-add-person\" \"synastry-aspect-${aspect.recordId}\" \"synastry-choose-${choice.id}\" \"synastry-creation-error\" \"synastry-export-pdf\" \"synastry-loading\" \"synastry-paid-analysis\" \"synastry-screen\" \n-- ui/locality/LocalityScreen.kt: \"locality-availability\" \"locality-busy\" \"locality-calculate\" \"locality-error\" \"locality-export-pdf\" \"locality-filter-${body.bodyId.identifier}\" \"locality-filter-all\" \"locality-history-${run.id}\" \"locality-line-${line.recordId}\" \"locality-paid-analysis\" \"locality-resolution-$value\" \"locality-screen\" \n-- ui/paid/PaidAnalysisScreen.kt: \"paid-active-section\" \"paid-buy\" \"paid-complete\" \"paid-delivery-pending\" \"paid-display-price\" \"paid-generation-progress\" \"paid-open-saved\" \"paid-order-status\" \"paid-refresh\" \"paid-refund-policy\" \"paid-resume-purchase\" \"paid-screen\" \"paid-selection-summary\" \"paid-server-generation\" \"paid-sources\" \"paid-sources-missing\" \"universal-library\" \n-- ui/chart/ChartScreen.kt: \"chart-analyses\" \"chart-angle-${angle.id.name}\" \"chart-back\" \"chart-birth-record\" \"chart-cusp-${cusp.houseIndex1}\" \"chart-detail\" \"chart-detail-close\" \"chart-dossier\" \"chart-element-library\" \"chart-export\" \"chart-full-help\" \"chart-houses-un