anthropic-java-vertex`\n- Enable native Google Antigravity CLI (`agy`) hooks in `.agents/hooks.json` and\n- Update the official Claude Code Action to v1.0.264 and Gradle Actions to\n- Remove monetary preparation/execution limits and their Android error states.\n- Read model, reasoning effort and processing service mode for all three AI\n- Use the direct official Anthropic API under the operator's updated billing\n- Pin `paid_v2_catalog_version` to the stable template identity\n- Let every Compose variant carry a unit-test component with Android resources\n- Plan analysis by explicit thematic section and evidence assignment, retain\n- Connect the 1,839-article free library to chart elements with structured text,\n- Use the official Argon streaming endpoint for the single native exchange;\n- Preserve content-free provider assessment diagnostics before durable execution\n- Record operator-authorized commercial activation in Cloud Run, with production\n- Preserve Cloud Run job rollback snapshots as JSON, avoiding the Cloud SDK's\n- Constrain the test module's Android Lint tool to Guava 33.7.2-jre. Native\n- Record remediation of the SCC service-account-key creation finding and the\n- Attribute the new SCC self-investigation event to the authorized deployment's\n- Fix PR #155 refund notification findings: bound pre-send failures, wait until\n- Record the operator-approved, bucket-specific storage-control exceptions with\n- Publish Android 0.3.15 (18) to the internal Play track, including the remaining\n- Add confirmed-refund notifications with platform-specific delivery: native push\n- Configure native Entire capture for Codex, Claude Code and Copilot CLI, with\n- Match OpenAI's native byte serialization when committing counted and generated\n- Send Orders checkout metadata required by Mercado Pago quality evaluation:\n- Allow all Mercado Pago-eligible methods, including boleto, per the operator's\n- Enable Mercado Pago's native production-account settlement and release 