h\n- Publish Android 0.3.15 (18) to the internal Play track, including the remaining\n- Add confirmed-refund notifications with platform-specific delivery: native push\n- Configure native Entire capture for Codex, Claude Code and Copilot CLI, with\n- Match OpenAI's native byte serialization when committing counted and generated\n- Send Orders checkout metadata required by Mercado Pago quality evaluation:\n- Allow all Mercado Pago-eligible methods, including boleto, per the operator's\n- Enable Mercado Pago's native production-account settlement and release report\n- Parse transaction-free Mercado Pago orders in `created` or `canceled` state\n- Canonicalize Mercado Pago's alphanumeric order ID to lowercase only for the\n- Expose `X-Content-Type-Options` alongside `Retry-After` to the two authorized\n- Record Mercado Pago's native webhook signature failure reason without exposing\n- Send Mercado Pago's required idempotency header when canceling an unpaid\n=== strings de recursos visiveis (nomes das secoes)\n66:    <string name=\"about_title\">Sobre</string>","is_error":false}]}}
