{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","hash":"905e8fdc9dd0711d69d3372783f5608b002a146d06ce5a2a709dd0c4982d52d9","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AJNXjpqReot617V65UdjvD","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers\\play\\README.md","old_string":"These files describe **Oráculo Celestial**, package `dev.lcv.astrologo`, for its\nPlay listing. The Portuguese and English text now covers the implemented local\nfeatures: natal charts and complements, transits, synastry, locality maps, saved\nhistory and PDF export. It explicitly keeps optional AI analysis unavailable.\nThe Portuguese and English descriptions match the native Play readback of\n17/10/2026. A repository merge does not send these files to Play; the dated\nrecords below identify the separate native API updates.","new_string":"These files describe **Oráculo Celestial**, package `dev.lcv.astrologo`, for its\nPlay listing. For 1.0.0 (versionCode 21), the first stable release (operator\ndecision of 30/10/2026), the Portuguese and English text presents the whole\nproduct: natal chart and its readings, the free library of more than 1,800\nelement explanations, transits, synastry, locality maps, saved history and PDF\nexport, and the optional paid complete analysis prepared on the server and\nkept in the account library (first real purchase delivered end to end on\n30/10/2026, LCV-464). The listing text names no payment provider and no price.\n`listings/graphics/phone/01..08.png` are the eight phone screenshots, taken\nfrom the real debug application on the `pixel_10_api37` emulator at\n1080×1920 (Play's two-to-one rule), in Portuguese, with real local\ncalculations. A repository merge does not send these files to Play; the dated\nrecords below identify the separate native API updates."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
