ums, communities, or the Internet Archive. If it is not possible to resolve a question using these resources, the operator must be consulted. The redundancy of procedures is strictly prohibited... The `D:` drive no longer exists. Save any materials... into a `temp\\` directory within each repository... Once the task is complete, delete this `temp\\` folder entirely, ensuring that everything which needs to be—or can be—saved is uploaded to GitHub or Linear. Repository branches/worktrees must be created exclusively within `C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\`. We follow a 'zero local retention' policy... All API credentials, keys and tokens are stored in 1Password. Open a single, persistent, hidden terminal session using `op run` and execute all commands that rely on these credentials, keys and tokens within that session. Dedicate your full effort to 'deep research'... Always prioritize the use of native, official solutions... As a general rule, the use of custom modifications is prohibited... The use of central controllers is prohibited... Utilize 'ultrabrain', cross-reviews (reserved for complex cases that warrant such an approach), and official documentation... ensure that all GitHub Projects, Discussions, and Issues—as well as Linear's Issues, Projects, Teams, Initiatives, Cycles, and Milestones, and Entire's Trails, Dispatches, Checkouts, and Memorys—are kept up to date, linked, cross-referenced, and synchronized.\"\n   - Operator decisions/orders in this stretch (all in force):\n     - Stuck web purchase: investigate → cause found and fixed via PR #168 (merged, deployed, published). Operator: \"O pedido no Mercado Pago está cancelado ---> acabei de cancelar.\" / \"Faço outro?\" / \"A correção precisa necessariamente de PR?\" / \"Se sim, porque?\" / \"É 1 PR só com tudo que tem que corrigir.\"\n     - Never ask \"1 ou 2 PRs\"; never propose a third-party ticket about a fact the operator already explained (he exploded: \"pergunta cretina... Você é uma co