er(Headers.USER_AGENT, \"MercadoPago Java SDK/${MercadoPagoConfig.CURRENT_VERSION}\")\n       .setHeader(Headers.PRODUCT_ID, MercadoPagoConfig.PRODUCT_ID)\n       .setHeader(Headers.TRACKING_ID, MercadoPagoConfig.TRACKING_ID)\n       ...\n       sdkHeaders.forEach { (name, value) -> builder.setHeader(name, value) }\n       ```\n       (parseOrder from #168 already tolerant: `SETTLED = setOf(\"processed\",\"refunded\",\"charged_back\")`, `paidAmount()` helper.)\n     - `backend/.../universalorders/UniversalOrderService.kt`: new ctor param `private val observeMissing: (MpUnavailable) -> Unit = { }`; in reconcileSweep read branch:\n       ```kotlin\n       val fresh = try { provider.read(order.mpOrderId) } catch (failure: MpUnavailable) {\n           if (failure.status !in 400..499 || failure.status == 429 || order.entitlement != UniversalEntitlement.NONE) throw failure\n           observeMissing(failure)\n           store.mutate(order.orderReference) { saved, _ ->\n               if (saved != order) saved else saved.copy(state = UniversalOrderState.ABANDONED,\n                   subjectName = null, nextRereadAt = null, manualCase = \"PROVIDER_RESOURCE_MISSING\")\n           }\n           return@reconcileItem\n       }\n       ```\n     - `backend/.../http/v2/V2Host.kt`: `observeMissing = { failure -> println(JsonObject { severity WARNING, event \"payment_order_missing_at_provider\", channel MERCADO_PAGO, outcome ABANDONED, providerStatus, providerCode }) }`.\n     - Tests: `UniversalOrderServiceTest.kt` Fixture adds `observeMissing = { failure -> deferrals += \"MISSING:${failure.status}:${failure.code}\" }` and new test `unpaidOrderTheProviderNoLongerKnowsIsAbandonedInsteadOfDeferredForever` (404 → ABANDONED/reconciled=1; 429/500/503 → deferred). `NativeMercadoPagoOrdersTest.kt` new test `everyProviderCallCarriesTheOfficialSdkIdentification` (StubHttpClient asserts the three headers on /users/me, /v1/orders/ORDTST123, cancel). Targeted run: BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 2m 29s.\n     - `app/build.gradle.kts`: `versionCode = 21`, `versionName = \"1.0.0\"`.\n     - `CHANGELOG.md`: new `## [1.0.0] — 30/10/2026` (\"First stable release...\" + 404 item + SDK headers item) above `[0.3.17]`.\n     - `README.md` lines ~21–29: 1.0.0 (21) first stable release paragraph; 0.3.17 (20) published internal 30/10 run 40994604713 and first real purchase.\n     - `play/release-notes/pt-BR.txt` / `en-US.txt`: \"1.0.0 — Primeira versão estável do Oráculo Celestial. ...\" (394 chars each).\n     - `play/listings/pt-BR/listing.json` and `en-US/listing.json`: shortDescription 78 chars (\"Mapa natal, trânsitos, sinastria, localidade e análise completa pelo servidor.\" / \"Birth chart, transits, synastry, locality map and a server-made full analysis.\"), fullDescription 2758/2693 chars (sections: MAPA NATAL, LEITURAS E EXPLICAÇÕES GRATUITAS (1.800+ artigos), TRÂNSITOS, SINASTRIA, MAPA DE LOCALIDADE, HISTÓRICO E PDF, ANÁLISE COMPLETA (opcional e paga, servidor, seções, notificação, 6 meses, mesma conta; \"preço e condições apresentados no próprio aplicativo\"), SUA CONTA E SEUS DADOS, pt/en, \"reflexão e autoconhecimento, não previsões\", contato). No payment provider or price named.\n     - `play/README.md` intro rewritten for 1.0.0 and screenshots `listings/graphics/phone/01..08.png` (files not yet produced).\n     - `app/src/androidTest/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/PlayListingCaptures.kt` (TEMPORARY, delete before commit): `createEmptyComposeRule()`, seeds two profiles via `BirthDatabase.get(application).profiles().save(...)` (Ana Beatriz 15/05/1990 14:30 Rio; Carlos Eduardo 22/11/1985 08:15 São Paulo), launches `ActivityScenario.launch(MainActivity::class.java)`, helpers `exists/waitFor(tag, timeout, container)` with `performScrollToNode`, `click(tag, container)`, `capture(name)` via `uiAutomation.takeScreenshot()` to `getExternalFilesDir(null)/play-capturas`; steps 01-inicio, 02-mapa-natal, 03-posicoes, 04-leituras, 05-biblioteca, 06-transitos, 07-sinastria, 08-lo