in 60000ms (container=profiles)`; failure screenshot shows pt-BR home scrolled to \"Sobre / Versão 1.0.0\" with no people list → the two seeded profiles were not visible. Verified `BirthDatabase.get` uses `Room.databaseBuilder(context.applicationContext, \"birth-profiles.db\").setDriver(BundledSQLiteDriver())` and DAO `@Upsert suspend fun save(profile)`; on device `/data/data/dev.lcv.astrologo/databases/birth-profiles.db` exists (4096 B + 247 KB WAL) but the sqlite3 query step exited 1 without output. Emulator ready (root, 1080×1920, app locale pt-BR). Build/install chain: `.\\gradlew.bat :app:assembleDebugAndroidTest`, `adb install -r -t app\\build\\outputs\\apk\\androidTest\\debug\\app-debug-androidTest.apk`, `pm clear` + `pm grant ... POST_NOTIFICATIONS` + `cmd locale set-app-locales`, `am instrument -w -r -e class dev.lcv.astrologo.PlayListingCaptures dev.lcv.astrologo.test/androidx.test.runner.AndroidJUnitRunner`, `adb pull /sdcard/Android/data/dev.lcv.astrologo/files/play-capturas temp\\capturas`.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Determine why seeded profiles don't appear (verify rows with `adb shell sqlite3 /data/data/dev.lcv.astrologo/databases/birth-profiles.db 'select id,name from birth_profiles'` — the previous attempt's command failed — and/or assert `dao.getAll()` inside the test before launching; if the real-app home needs a different seeding path, fall back to creating the profiles through the editor UI), then rerun captures to obtain the eight PNGs, convert to 24-bit, visually review each, continue with gates, commit (with `entire session attach`), PR, Play upload, and deliver the Codex prompt. Operator's governing words: \"São 8 imagens no total (quantidade máxima), então precisam ser imagens bonitas e que apresentam as principais telas do app.\" and \"(b) ... --> faça.\" / \"(d) --> resolva.\"\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: C:\\Us