b_diretivas_2026_10.md)\n\n## Projetos / estado\n\n- [Oráculo: servidor faz tudo, app só recebe pronto + notificação](project_astrologo_server_does_everything_notify_when_ready.md) H · [Oráculo SEM usuários: não publicado, ninguém instalou/comprou; nunca desenhar nem perguntar por legado](feedback_oraculo_has_no_users_never_design_for_legacy_users.md) H\n- [Astrólogo pago: estado e PRs de 22/10](project_astrologo_paid_launch_state_2026_10_18.md) — #115 deploy GHA; paga sempre PT_BR · [fontes: peso igual; lente Jung](project_astrologo_library_licensed_astrolink_personare.md) H · [tudo no Linear/GitHub](feedback_store_all_learning_in_the_respective_issues_for_web_and_ios.md) H\n\n- [Android e iOS: estado e decisões](project_hub_android_ios.md) — distribuição, iOS, Swift, Swiss Ephemeris · [R8 sempre](feedback_every_android_version_ships_r8_optimized.md) H · [minSdk 36](project_android_apps_min_sdk_no_backward_compatibility.md) H · [iOS sem Mac local](project_ios_no_local_mac_build_and_simulator_on_github_actions.md) H · [iOS: nada até inscrição ATIVA](feedback_ios_no_development_until_apple_enrollment_active.md) H\n- [Histórico de estados concluídos](project_hub_historico.md) — 29/08 a 20/09 e encerrados de 10/2026\n- Docs: `version_control`, `infra_directives`, `app_memories_ref`, `ai_agents_files`, `user_subscription_tier`\n- [kotlin-lsp: NÃO instalar o servidor JetBrains (29/10)](feedback_kotlin_lsp_server_do_not_install.md) H\n</system-reminder>"},{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nAs you answer the user's questions, you can use the following context:\n# userEmail\nThe user's email address is lcv@lcv.dev. Use it only to identify the user, such as for authorship, attribution, or filtering their own work. Never send it to an unrelated service, such as in a request header, URL, or payload, unless the user explicitly asks.\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<system-reminder>\n<tools-used-before-summary>Agent, AskUserQuestion, Bash, CronCreate, CronList, Edit, Glob, Grep, ListAgents, Monitor, PowerShell, PushNotification, Read, SendMessage, Skill, TaskStop, ToolSearch, WebFetch, WebSearch, Workflow, Write, advisor, mcp__claude_ai_Gmail__get_message, mcp__claude_ai_Gmail__search_threads, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__create_attachment_from_upload, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__get_attachment, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__get_document, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__get_issue, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__get_project, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__get_status_updates, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__list_comments, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__list_documents, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__list_issue_labels, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__list_issue_statuses, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__list_issues, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__list_milestones, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__list_projects, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__list_teams, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__prepare_attachment_upload, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__save_comment, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__save_document, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__save_issue, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__save_project, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__save_status_update, mcp__claude_ai_Linear__search_documentation, mcp__cross-review__runtime_capabilities, mcp__cross-review__server_info, mcp__cross-review__session_attach_evidence, mcp__cross-review__session_finalize, mcp__cross-review__session_init, mcp__cross-review__session_poll, mcp__cross-review__session_preflight_check, mcp__cross-review__session_start_round, mcp__entire__agent_help, mcp__entire__entire_status, mcp__github__actions_get, mcp__github__actions_list, mcp__github__actions_run_trigger, mcp__github__add_issue_comment, mcp__github__add_reply_to_pull_request_comment, mcp__github__create_branch, mcp__github__create_pull_request, mcp__github__discussion_comment_write, mcp__github__get_discussion, mcp__github__get_file_contents, mcp__github__get_job_logs, mcp__github__issue_read, mcp__github__issue_write, mcp__github__list_commits, mcp__github__list_discussion_categories, mcp__github__list_discussions, mcp__github__list_issues, mcp__github__list_pull_requests, mcp__github__list_releases, mcp__github__projects_list, mcp__github__projects_write, mcp__github__pull_request_read, mcp__github__repository_ruleset_read, mcp__github__search_code, mcp__github__search_issues, mcp__github__search_pull_requests, mcp__github__search_repositories, mcp__github__update_pull_request, mcp__google-dev-docs__search_documents, mcp__plugin_firebase_firebase__crashlytics_get_report, mcp__plugin_firebase_firebase__developerknowledge_search_documents, mcp__plugin_firebase_firebase__firebase_get_environment, mcp__plugin_firebase_firebase__firebase_list_apps, mcp__plugin_firebase_firebase__firebase_update_environment, mcp__plugin_firebase_firebase__firestore_get_document, mcp__plugin_firebase_firebase__firestore_list_collections, mcp__plugin_firebase_firebase__firestore_query_collection</tools-used-before-summary>\n</system-reminder>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   - Standing /goal (verbatim, still active): \"Any claims or assertions you make must be thoroughly and irrefutably proven or demonstrated! I require concrete, irrefutable evidence for anything you label as 'pending' or 'inconclusive.' Always use the date and time formats standard in Brazil. Your internal communication should always take place in your native language, but when communicating with the operator, the use of Brazilian Portuguese is mandatory. It is strictly forbidden to infer, presume, guess, hallucinate, fabricate, or make decisions on one's own. In the absence of data or information, it is mandatory to actively consult official documentation, forums, communities, or the Internet Archive. If it is not possible to resolve a question using these resources, the operator must be consulted. The redundancy of procedures is strictly prohibited... The `D:` drive no longer exists. Save any materials... into a `temp\\` directory within each repository... Once the task is complete, delete this `temp\\` folder entirely, ensuring that everything which needs to be—or can be—saved is uploaded to GitHub or Linear. Repository branches/worktrees must be created exclusively within `C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\`. We follow a 'zero local retention' policy... All API credentials, keys and tokens are stored in 1Password. Open a single, persistent, hidden terminal session using `op run` and execute all commands that rely on these credentials, keys and tokens within that session. Dedicate your full effort to 'deep research'... Always prioritize the use of native, official solutions... As a general rule, the use of custom modifications is prohibited... The use of central controllers is prohibited... Utilize 'ultrabrain', cross-reviews (reserved for complex cases that warrant such an approach), and official documentation... ensure that all GitHub Projects, Discussions, and Issues—as well as Linear's Issues, Projects, Teams, Initiatives, Cycles, and Milestones, and Entire's Trails, Dispatches, Checkouts, and Memorys—are kept up to date, linked, cross-referenced, and synchronized.\"\n   - Operator decisions/orders in this stretch (all in force):\n     - Stuck web purchase: investigate → cause found and fixed via PR #168 (merged, deployed, published). Operator: \"O pedido no Mercado Pago está cancelado ---> acabei de cancelar.\" / \"Faço outro?\" / \"A correção precisa necessariamente de PR?\" / \"Se sim, porque?\" / \"É 1 PR só com tudo que tem que corrigir.\"\n     - Never ask \"1 ou 2 PRs\"; never propose a third-party ticket about a fact the operator already explained (he exploded: \"pergunta cretina... Você é uma coisa nojenta!!\").\n     - \"Em paralelo, investigue porque, depois do reload da janela, calculadora-android e maestro-android aparecem com a branch suja com vários untracked files. Verifique se isso tem relação com a extensão do Gradle.\" → done.\n     - PET error paste → \"É possível usar C:\\Python315\\python.exe?\" → \"Aplique as três configurações.\" → done.\n     - \"Eu gosto de usar o market place do vscode. Tem como configurar o Antigravity para usar o marketplace do VSCode em vez do open vsx?\" → answered (ToS 2.b forbids; product.json customization).\n     - \"Você criou PR via API de novo né?\" → No (gh pr create in opx; proven).\n     - \"Enquanto espera, há 6 findings no GCP/SCC.\" → analyzed; \"(a) ... --> APAGA\" executed.\n     - \"Já dispara também a publicação à Play.\" → done (0.3.17 (20)).\n     - \"Vou testar agora!\" → real purchase succeeded end to end; notification worked; \"Isso aqui também é novo para mim...\" web progress screen; \"Só que não ocorreu nenhuma atualização na tela.\" → browser wasn't polling; \"Agora começou a andar.\"; \"Do jeito que tudo está agora... conseguirei também recuperar a análise no app android?\" → yes with same account; later \"(c) ---> funcionou. Já recuperei.\"\n     - \"Redija um prompt informando a Codex todo o progresso, todos os resultados e o fechamento ao qual você concluiu.\" → NOT YET DELIVERED.\n     - \"(b) Próxima PR com bump: saída para 404 na varredura ... e cabeçalhos do SDK nas leituras do Mercado Pago --> faça.\" → in progress.\n     - \"(d) Commit sem checkpoint do Entire ... --> resolva.\"\n     - \"IMPORTANTE: Vamos promover o app android à v1.0.0 e torna-lo público na Play Store.\" / \"Primeira versão estável.\"\n     - \"Agora, as notas de lançamento devem ser uma nota com a apresentação do app, tudo o que ele faz e oferece. É a apresentação do produto na Play Store.\"\n     - \"É preciso também atualizar as imagens do app na página de detalhes do app na Play Store. As imagens que estão lá são antigas.\" / \"São 8 imagens no total (quantidade máxima), então precisam ser imagens