{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","hash":"a99a18bd6e06aa78ea705d064ed45219d0821468461ca4e957f0c04ca70244cf","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Preciso dos dados reais da tabela de perfis no banco do emulador, lendo os arquivos db, wal e shm com o sqlite3 do Python, e do trecho de ProfilesScreen que define o que aparece se a lista vier vazia. Vou pedir os dois agora, pois são independentes.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HXg3WBJ7JsgbnrqCZNjpai","name":"PowerShell","input":{"command":"$adb = \"$env:LOCALAPPDATA\\Android\\Sdk\\platform-tools\\adb.exe\"; $d = \"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers\\temp\\db\"; New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force $d | Out-Null; foreach ($f in @('birth-profiles.db','birth-profiles.db-wal','birth-profiles.db-shm')) { & $adb pull \"/data/data/dev.lcv.astrologo/databases/$f\" \"$d\\$f\" 2>&1 | Select-Object -Last 1 }; python -X utf8 -I -c \"import sqlite3; c=sqlite3.connect(r'$d\\birth-profiles.db'); print('tabelas:', [r[0] for r in c.execute(\\\"select name from sqlite_master where type='table'\\\")]); print('perfis:', list(c.execute('select id,name,updatedAtEpochMilli from birth_profiles'))); print('snapshots:', c.execute('select count(*) from chart_snapshots').fetchone())\"","description":"Puxa o banco do app do emulador e lê a tabela de perfis com o sqlite3 do Python","timeout":60000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01V5VSyDM2btX9YtWB7doDva","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers && sed -n '340,352p' app/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/ui/AstrologoApp.kt; echo \"=== ProfilesScreen 397-420\" && sed -n '397,420p' app/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/ui/AstrologoApp.kt | cut -c1-160","description":"Lê a condição que escolhe a tela inicial e o início da lista de pesso