{"parentUuid":"281ce4c5-35d9-4fe4-bc97-9565adb53197","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-mythos-5-1","id":"msg_011CgXmkupX38DvJqjB7ddHA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KTh1pXq4VU9naMUztVf4ut","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python -X utf8 -I - <<'EOF'\np='play/README.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\nold='free element library, transits, synastry and locality map. A repository merge does not send these files to Play; the dated\\nrecords below identify the separate native API updates.'\nnew='free element library, transits, synastry and locality map. A repository\\nmerge does not send these files to Play; the dated records below identify\\nthe separate native API updates.'\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new); open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='\\n').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\ncat > temp/commit-msg.txt <<'EOF'\nRelease 1.0.0 (21): settle provider-missing orders, SDK headers on every MP call, Play listing\n\nFirst stable release by operator decision of 30/10/2026, after the first real\nweb purchase was delivered end to end on 0.3.17 (20).\n\nBackend:\n- reconcileSweep: an unpaid CHECKOUT_READY/PAYMENT_PENDING order whose\n  authoritative read answers a definitive 4xx (not 429) and that holds no\n  entitlement moves to ABANDONED (manualCase PROVIDER_RESOURCE_MISSING,\n  nextRereadAt null) instead of being deferred every minute; new\n  observeMissing hook logs payment_order_missing_at_provider from V2Host.\n  429 and 5xx remain transient. Two ORDTST orders of 27/10/2026 answering\n  404 order_not_found motivated it (LCV-464).\n- NativeMercadoPagoOrders.request: every provider call carries the official\n  SDK identification (User-Agent MercadoPago Java SDK/<CURRENT_VERSION>,\n  X-Product-Id, X-Tracking-Id from MercadoPagoConfig), as\n  MercadoPagoClient.addDefaultHeaders does for the SDK-serialized creation.\n- Tests: unpaidOrderTheProviderNoLongerKnowsIsAbandonedInsteadOfDeferredForever,\n  everyProviderCallCarriesTheOfficialSdkIdentification.\n\nApp and Play:\n- versionCode 21, versionName 1.0.0; CHANGELOG and README.\n- play/listings pt-BR and en-US: product presentation (short 78 chars, full\n  2758/2693 chars); release notes as the product presentation (394 chars);\n  eight new phone screenshots (1080x1800, 24-bit RGB) from the real debug\n  app on pixel_10_api37 in Portuguese; play/README.md records them.\n\nRefs LCV-464\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\necho written","description":"Quebra a linha longa no play/README.md e grava a mensagem de commit em temp/"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13411,"cache_read_input_tokens":227950,"output_tokens":1248,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":177},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13411,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":1248,"cache_read_input_tokens":227950,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13411,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13411},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01KTh1pXq4VU9naMUztVf4ut":{"command":"cd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers && python -X utf8 -I - <<'EOF'\np='play/README.md'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\nold='free element library, transits, synastry and locality map. A repository merge does not send these files to Play; the dated\\nrecords below identify the separate native API updates.'\nnew='free element library, transits, synastry and locality map. A repository\\nmerge does not send these files to Play; the dated records below identify\\nthe separate native API updates.'\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new); open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='\\n').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\ncat > temp/commit-msg.txt <<'EOF'\nRelease 1.0.0 (21): settle provider-missing orders, SDK headers on every MP call, Play listing\n\nFirst stable release by operator decision of 30/10/2026, after the first real\nweb purchase was delivered end to end on 0.3.17 (20).\n\nBackend:\n- reconcileSweep: an unpaid CHECKOUT_READY/PAYMENT_PENDING order whose\n  authoritative read answers a definitive 4xx (not 429) and that holds no\n  entitlement moves to ABANDONED (manualCase PROVIDER_RESOURCE_MISSING,\n  nextRereadAt null) instead of being deferred every minute; new\n  observeMissing hook logs payment_order_missing_at_provider from V2Host.\n  429 and 5xx remain transient. Two ORDTST orders of 27/10/2026 answering\n  404 order_not_found motivated it (LCV-464).\n- NativeMercadoPagoOrders.request: every provider call carries the official\n  SDK identification (User-Agent MercadoPago Java SDK/<CURRENT_VERSION>,\n  X-Product-Id, X-Tracking-Id from MercadoPagoConfig), as\n  MercadoPagoClient.addDefaultHeaders does for the SDK-serialized creation.\n- Tests: unpaidOrderTheProviderNoLongerKnowsIsAbandonedInsteadOfDeferredForever,\n  everyProviderCallCarriesTheOfficialSdkIdentification.\n\nApp and Play:\n- versionCode 21, versionName 1.0.0; CHANGELOG and README.\n- play/listings pt-BR and en-US: product presentation (short 78 chars, full\n  2758/2693 chars); release notes as the product presentation (394 chars);\n  eight new phone screenshots (1080x1800, 24-bit RGB) from the real debug\n  app on pixel_10_api37 in Portuguese; play/README.md records them.\n\nRefs LCV-464\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\necho written","description":"Quebra a linha longa no play/README.md e grava a mensagem de commit em temp/"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01KTh1pXq4VU9naMUztVf4ut":{"cwd":"/c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-4