{"parentUuid":"7191075a-c4d6-43ca-b3da-daffc76d4824","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-mythos-5-1","id":"msg_011CgXnL2t5hZNcxoBec23G1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YXtkTBwcvd4vCSLtdPu9Py","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > temp/pr-body.md <<'EOF'\nRefs LCV-464 · [LCV-464](https://linear.app/lcv-ideas-software/issue/LCV-464)\n\nFirst stable release by operator decision of 30/10/2026, after the first real web purchase was delivered end to end on 0.3.17 (20) (PR #168, run 40994604713).\n\n## Backend\n\n1. **Provider-missing orders settle instead of deferring forever.** In `reconcileSweep`, an unpaid `CHECKOUT_READY`/`PAYMENT_PENDING` order whose authoritative read answers a definitive 4xx (not 429) and that holds no entitlement moves to `ABANDONED` (`manualCase PROVIDER_RESOURCE_MISSING`, `nextRereadAt` null). New `observeMissing` hook; `V2Host` logs `payment_order_missing_at_provider`. 429 and 5xx stay transient. Motivation: two test-environment orders of 27/10/2026 (`ORDTST…`) answered `404 order_not_found` to the production credential and were deferred every minute since 28/10/2026.\n2. **Official SDK identification on every Mercado Pago call.** `NativeMercadoPagoOrders.request` now sets `User-Agent: MercadoPago Java SDK/<CURRENT_VERSION>`, `X-Product-Id` and `X-Tracking-Id` from `MercadoPagoConfig`, the same values `MercadoPagoClient.addDefaultHeaders` adds to the SDK-serialized creation; reads, cancellations, refunds and searches went out without them. Motivated by the \"SDK do backend\" recommendation on the integration-quality panel (97/100, 30/10/2026).\n3. Tests: `unpaidOrderTheProviderNoLongerKnowsIsAbandonedInsteadOfDeferredForever` (404 → ABANDONED; 429/500/503 → deferred) and `everyProviderCallCarriesTheOfficialSdkIdentification`.\n\n## App and Play listing (1.0.0, versionCode 21)\n\n1. `versionCode 21`, `versionName \"1.0.0\"`; CHANGELOG `[1.0.0] — 30/10/2026`; README.\n2. `play/listings/{pt-BR,en-US}/listing.json`: product presentation (short 78 chars, full 2758/2693 chars; no payment provider or price named). `play/release-notes`: the product presentation (394 chars each).\n3. `play/listings/graphics/phone/01..08.png`: eight new phone screenshots from the real debug app on `pixel_10_api37`, pt-BR, 1080×1800 24-bit RGB (status bar cropped): home, natal wheel, planets and houses, readings, free element library, transits, synastry, locality map. `play/README.md` records them. A merge does not send them to Play; the Play Developer API update follows the merge.\n\n## Local gates (30/10/2026, JDK 27+35, PowerShell)\n\n| Gate | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `:app:assembleDebug :app:assembleDebugAndroidTest` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 20s |\n| `:app:lintDebug :app:lintRelease` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 5m 39s |\n| `testDebugUnitTest :backend:test :core:analysis:test` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 1m 33s |\n\n## After merge\n\nOne `deploy-backend.yml` run; listing texts and screenshots via the Play Developer API; `publish-play.yml` on the production track for 1.0.0 (21).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ncat > /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/pr-100.ps1 <<'EOF'\n$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\nSet-Location 'C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers'\ngit push -u origin claude/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers 2>&1 | Out-String\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"git push falhou\" }\ngh pr create --repo LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android --base main --head claude/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers --label Claude --title 'Release 1.0.0 (21): settle provider-missing orders, SDK headers on every MP call, Play listing' --body-file temp/pr-body.md 2>&1 | Out-String\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"gh pr create falhou\" }\ngh pr view --repo LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android claude/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers --json number,url,labels,isDraft,headRefOid --jq '{number,url,isDraft,headRefOid,labels:[.labels[].name]}'\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Grava o corpo da PR e o script de push + gh pr create para o terminal opx"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":919,"cache_read_input_tokens":253500,"output_tokens":2676,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":834},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":919,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":2676,"cache_read_input_tokens":253500,"cache_creation_input_tokens":919,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":919},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01YXtkTBwcvd4vCSLtdPu9Py":{"command":"cd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers && cat > temp/pr-body.md <<'EOF'\nRefs LCV-464 · [LCV-464](https://linear.app/lcv-ideas-software/issue/LCV-464)\n\nFirst stable release by operator decision of 30/10/2026, after the first real web purchase was delivered end to end on 0.3.17 (20) (PR #168, run 40994604713).\n\n## Backend\n\n1. **Provider-missing orders settle instead of deferring forever.** In `reconcileSweep`, an unpaid `CHECKOUT_READY`/`PAYMENT_PENDING` order whose authoritative read answers a definitive 4xx (not 429) and that holds no entitlement moves to `ABANDONED` (`manualCase PROVIDER_RESOURCE_MISSING`, `nextRereadAt` null). New `observeMissing` hook; `V2Host` logs `payment_order_missing_at_provider`. 429 and 5xx stay transient. Motivation: two test-environment orders of 27/10/2026 (`ORDTST…`) answered `404 order_not_found` to the production credential and were deferred every minute since 28/10/2026.\n2. **Official SDK identification on every Mercado Pago call.** `NativeMercadoPagoOrders.request` now sets `User-Agent: MercadoPago Java SDK/<CURRENT_VERSION>`, `X-Product-Id` and `X-Tracking-Id` from `MercadoPagoConfig`, the same values `MercadoPagoClient.addDefaultHeaders` adds to the SDK-serialized creation; reads, cancellations, refunds and searches went out without them. Motivated by the \"SDK do backend\" recommendation on the integration-quality panel (97/100, 30/10/2026).\n3. Tests: `unpaidOrderTheProviderNoLongerKnowsIsAbandonedInsteadOfDeferredForever` (404 → ABANDONED; 429/500/503 → deferred) and `everyProviderCallCarriesTheOfficialSdkIdentification`.\n\n## App and Play listing (1.0.0, versionCode 21)\n\n1. `versionCode 21`, `versionName \"1.0.0\"`; CHANGELOG `[1.0.0] — 30/10/2026`; README.\n2. `play/listings/{pt-BR,en-US}/listing.json`: product presentation (short 78 chars, full 2758/2693 chars; no payment provider or price named). `play/release-notes`: the product presentation (394 chars each).\n3. `play/listings/graphics/phone/01..08.png`: eight new phone screenshots from the real debug app on `pixel_10_api37`, pt-BR, 1080×1800 24-bit RGB (status bar cropped): home, natal wheel, planets and houses, readings, free element library, transits, synastry, locality map. `play/README.md` records them. A merge does not send them to Play; the Play Developer API update follows the merge.\n\n## Local gates (30/10/2026, JDK 27+35, PowerShell)\n\n| Gate | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `:app:assembleDebug :app:assembleDebugAndroidTest` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 20s |\n| `:app:lintDebug :app:lintRelease` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 5m 39s |\n| `testDebugUnitTest :backend:test :core:analysis:test` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 1m 33s |\n\n## After merge\n\nOne `deploy-backend.yml` run; listing texts and screenshots via the Play Developer API; `publish-play.yml` on the production track for 1.0.0 (21).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ncat > /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/pr-100.ps1 <<'EOF'\n$ErrorActio