{"parentUuid":"b93cf47f-aa2d-463b-99a1-79fcc865b5a6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-mythos-5-1","id":"msg_011CgXnqVfDCg4uErZPTbAC3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ed8xpkY79pMeV7xjTsB6xX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git diff --stat && cat > temp/commit-msg-2.txt <<'EOF'\nAbandon only on a confirmed 404 order_not_found; keep 400/401/403 transient\n\nReview of PR #170 (Codex, Claude bot) and Entire trail 223 (three findings):\nthe previous guard treated every 4xx except 429 as \"the provider no longer\nknows this order\", so a revoked or misbound credential (401/403) or a 400\nwould have moved every due unpaid order to ABANDONED with no further\nreread, and a later accredited webhook would have refunded instead of\ndelivering (MpOrderTransitions.observe → NOT_GRANTABLE).\n\nThe sweep now settles only on the confirmed missing-resource answer\n(status 404 and code order_not_found); everything else keeps the transient\npath (deferred, logged, resumed once the credential is repaired). The test\ncovers 429, 500, 503, 400, 401, 403, a bare 404 and a 404 with another code.\nCHANGELOG wording follows.\n\nRefs LCV-464\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ncat > /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/commit-170-2.ps1 <<'EOF'\n$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\nSet-Location 'C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers'\ngit add -- CHANGELOG.md backend\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"git add falhou\" }\ngit commit -q -F temp/commit-msg-2.txt\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"git commit falhou\" }\ngit push origin claude/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers 2>&1 | Out-String\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"git push falhou\" }\ngit log -1 --format='%H %G? %s'\nentire session attach 3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88 --force 2>&1 | Select-Object -Last 4 | Out-String\nEOF\necho prepared","description":"Prepara a mensagem e o script do commit de correção (commit, push e anexo do Entire)"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1957,"cache_read_input_tokens":305537,"output_tokens":1039,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":149},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1957,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":1039,"cache_read_input_tokens":305537,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1957,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1957},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Ed8xpkY79pMeV7xjTsB6xX":{"command":"cd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers && git diff --stat && cat > temp/commit-msg-2.txt <<'EOF'\nAbandon only on a confirmed 404 order_not_found; keep 400/401/403 transient\n\nReview of PR #170 (Codex, Claude bot) and Entire trail 223 (three findings):\nthe previous guard treated every 4xx except 429 as \"the provider no longer\nknows this order\", so a revoked or misbound credential (401/403) or a 400\nwould have moved every due unpaid order to ABANDONED with no further\nreread, and a later accredited webhook would have refunded instead of\ndelivering (MpOrderTransitions.observe → NOT_GRANTABLE).\n\nThe sweep now settles only on the confirmed missing-resource answer\n(status 404 and code order_not_found); everything else keeps the transient\npath (deferred, logged, resumed once the credential is repaired). The test\ncovers 429, 500, 503, 400, 401, 403, a bare 404 and a 404 with another code.\nCHANGELOG wording follows.\n\nRefs LCV-464\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ncat > /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/g