{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","hash":"7c3358c1ad5bf23870ca79465015e5b7095bf565012768e39da697771a08b155","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QjQJ62wruq7kViRrg7YZrn","name":"mcp__github__add_reply_to_pull_request_comment","input":{"owner":"LCV-Ideas-Software","repo":"astrologo-android","pullNumber":170,"commentId":4420424886,"body":"Fixed in 1887209: the sweep settles only on `status == 404 && code == \"order_not_found\"`; 400, 401, 403, a bare 404 and a 404 with any other code keep the transient path (deferred, logged, resumed once the credential is repaired). `unpaidOrderTheProviderNoLongerKnowsIsAbandonedInsteadOfDeferredForever` now asserts all of those stay `CHECKOUT_READY` with `nextRereadAt = now + 60s`. Local gates on the fix (30/10/2026): build 17s, lint 2m05s, tests 43s, all BUILD SUCCESSFUL."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NxqV2A88yLsPZvGbaMYnur","name":"mcp__github__add_reply_to_pull_request_comment","input":{"owner":"LCV-Ideas-Software","repo":"astrologo-android","pullNumber":170,"commentId":4420426283,"body":"Fixed in 1887209 with the suggested guard (`failure.status != 404 || failure.code != \"order_not_found\" || order.entitlement != NONE` → rethrow). The test covers 429/500/503, 400/401/403, a bare 404 and a 404 with another code: all deferred, untouched. CHANGELOG wording updated."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012eCzD5ek6W2THQ2rSN6LCs","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers && entire trail finding resolve --help 2>&1 | sed -n '1,12p'; entire trail finding list 223 --repo gh/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android --freshness any 2>&1 | tail -5","description":"Confere como resolver findings do Entire e o estado deles após o novo commit","timeout":90000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VwAMJsdex3F1UtAtsa5BEF","name":"mcp__github__pull_request_read","input":{"method":"get_comments","owner":"LCV-Ideas-Software","repo":"astrologo-android","pullNumber":170,"perPage":3,"page":2},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
