{"parentUuid":"13623094-2df3-4927-835f-f5da2f48bcaf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-mythos-5-1","id":"msg_011CgXoFH8Zcq9fGam6XGPww","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01C8jqhRQdrvCBPzQZcYdmvn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python -X utf8 -I - <<'EOF'\np='backend/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/universalorders/UniversalOrderService.kt'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\nold='''                            // Only the confirmed missing-resource answer (404 order_not_found) on the authoritative\n                            // resource: the provider does not know this order under this credential (test-environment\n                            // orders read with the production token, for example). Nothing was granted, so deferring\n                            // it forever only costs a provider call per minute. Every other failure, including 400,\n                            // 401 and 403 that come from our credential rather than from the order, stays transient\n                            // and keeps being deferred (LCV-464, 30/10/2026; PR #170 review).\n'''\nnew='''                            // Only a confirmed 404 order_not_found on an unentitled order settles; every other failure\n                            // (including 400/401/403 from our own credential) stays transient and is deferred.\n'''\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nold2='/** Called once per unpaid order the provider no longer knows (4xx on the authoritative read). */'\nnew2='/** Called once per unentitled order whose authoritative read answers a confirmed `404 order_not_found`. */'\nassert old2 in s; s=s.replace(old2,new2)\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='\\n').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\ncat > temp/commit-msg-3.txt <<'EOF'\nShorten the settle comment and fix the observeMissing KDoc\n\nEntire trail 223 findings 01M65HAY1V0H and 01M65HAY1DTM on 1887209: the\ninline comment narrated history that already lives in the CHA