{"parentUuid":"84661fd0-b3f4-4f64-9d5b-74a90a9629f7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ca7f7a62-2c98-4c13-acad-efff44eb1c51","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MJecqnttqmG9bBdbAzuX6W","type":"tool_result","content":"=== main CHANGELOG topo\n# Changelog\n\nAll material changes to Astrologo Android are recorded here.\n\n## [Unreleased]\n\n- Update the official Linear Release Action to v0.18.2 and Claude Code Action\n  to v1.0.265 at their complete immutable release commit SHAs, preserving the\n  existing workflow inputs and official Linear CLI v0.18.0 (LCV-488).\n\n## [0.3.17] — 30/10/2026\n\n- Read Mercado Pago orders whose money has not settled without a paid amount:\n  the official \"Get order by ID\" reference declares `total_paid_amount` and\n  `transactions.payments[].paid_amount` optional, and the operator's real web\n  order of 29/10/2026 came back with one canceled card attempt and neither\n  field. The parser required both whenever a transaction existed, so every read\n  of that order failed as \"provider unavailable\" from 21h38 on: the webhook\n  answered 503 twice, the reconciliation sweep deferred the order every minute\n  in silence, and the browser kept polling an order that never changed state.\n  An absent amount now reads as zero for `created`, `action_required`,\n  `processing`, `failed` and `canceled` orders and payments, which can never\n=== README diff da main\ndiff --git a/README.md b/README.md\nindex 660f042..5942227 100644\n--- a/README.md\n+++ b/README.md\n@@ -506,7 +506,7 @@ bootstrap does not convert them in bulk.\n   Security updates have their own group and do not wait for the version-update\n   schedule or cooldown. If one member fails, diagnose it and adjust native\n   grouping so other fixes can proceed through the required checks.\n-- The official Linear Release Action v0.18.1 and CLI v0.18.0 record `main` commit\n+- The official Linear Release Action v0.18.2 and CLI v0.18.0 record `main` commit\n   history in the dedicated continuous pipeline, using the existing\n   `linear-release` environment and native `queue: max`. This records repository\n   history, not proof of an Android release or a Pages deployment; a sync","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d484c2fc-6fc3-4f0f-8e42-f3be542bb12c","timestamp":"2026-10-30T04:40:51.181Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== main CHANGELOG topo\n# Changelog\n\nAll material changes to Astrologo Android are recorded here.\n\n## [Unreleased]\n\n- Update the official Linear Release Action to v0.18.2 and Claude Code Action\n  to v1.0.265 at their complete immutable release commit SHAs, preserving the\n  existing workflow inputs and official Linear CLI v0.18.0 (LCV-488).\n\n## [0.3.17] — 30/10/2026\n\n- Read Mercado Pago orders whose money has not settled without a paid amount:\n  the official \"Get order by ID\" reference declares `total_paid_amount` and\n  `transactions.payments[].paid_amount` optional, and the operator's real web\n  order of 29/10/2026 came back with one canceled card attempt and neither\n  field. The parser required both whenever a transaction existed, so every read\n  of that order failed as \"provider unavailable\" from 21h38 on: the webhook\n  answered 503 twice, the reconciliation sweep deferred the order every minute\n  in silence, and the browser kept polling an order that never changed state.\n  An absent amount now reads as zero for `created`, `action_required`,\n  `processing`, `failed` and `canceled` orders and payments, which can never\n=== README diff da main\ndiff --git a/README.md b/README.md\nindex 660f042..5942227 100644\n--- a/README.md\n+++ b/README.md\n@@ -506,7 +506,7 @@ bootstrap does not convert them in bulk.\n   Security updates have their own group and do not wait for the version-update\n   schedule or cooldown. If one member fails, diagnose it and adjust native\n   grouping so other fixes can proceed through the required checks.\n-- The official Linear Release Action v0.18.1 and CLI v0.18.0 record `main` commit\n+- The official Linear Release Action v0.18.2 and CLI v0.18.0 record `main` commit\n   history in the dedicated continuous pipeline, using the existing\n   `linear-release` environment and native `queue: max`. This records repository\n   history, not proof of an Android release or a Pages deployment; a sync","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"84661fd0-b3f4-4f64-9d5b-74a90a9629f7","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glistening-tumbling-prism"}
