rrorCode.INVALID_ARGUMENT))\n                        remove(account, hash, updated)\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    /** Per-device acceptance is persisted by the outbox; transient FCM failures remain retryable. */\n    fun sendRefund(origin: String, reference: String, alreadyAccepted: Set<String>, accepted: (String, String) -> Unit): Int {\n        executionHash(reference)\n        var count = 0\n        val unique = linkedSetOf<String>()\n        for (account in accounts.resolveGroup(origin).owners) {\n            for ((hash, row) in entries(targets(account).get().get(15, TimeUnit.SECONDS).data)) {\n                val fid = row[\"fid\"] as String; val updated = row[\"updatedAt\"] as String\n                if (Instant.parse(updated) <= clock.instant().minus(Duration.ofDays(30))) { remove(account, hash, updated); continue }\n                if (device(hash).get().get(15, TimeUnit.SECONDS).getString(\"accountHash\") != account || !unique.add(hash)) continue\n                if (hash in alreadyAccepted) { count++; continue }\n                val id = try { messaging.send(refundMessage(fid, reference)) }\n                catch (failure: FirebaseMessagingException) {\n                    if (failure.messagingErrorCode != MessagingErrorCode.UNREGISTERED) throw failure\n                    remove(account, hash, updated)\n                    continue\n                }\n                accepted(hash, id)\n                count++\n            }\n        }\n        return count\n    }","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ee0bde38-ab2a-4cf2-946a-5fdeba64ebb6","timestamp":"2026-10-30T04:43:17.983Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"backend/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/provider/ProviderAttemptDiagnostics.kt\n31-    internal fun encodeReturned(number: Int, nativeRequestHash: String, evidence: NativeGenerationEvidence): String =\n32-        json.writeValueAsString(nativeFields(number, nativeRequestHash, evidence).apply {\n33-            put(\"severity\", \