{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","hash":"96c05f505b22795ba26109f062794a5a8b04aa964369148f97ae916b783d891e","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LCUDBjX7mUJUbbeRNhxs2V","type":"tool_result","content":"3:package dev.lcv.astrologo.backend.provider\n11: * return the transient rejected attempt to a device, and its checkpoint deliberately contains no provider\n12: * response. Preserve the decision here, before settlement/purge can discard the only diagnostic evidence.\n26:    /** The provider has returned; settlement and final acceptance have not run and may themselves fail. */\n32:        decision: ProviderAcceptanceDecision): String {\n34:            // An accepted answer whose native usage could not be priced still needs attention.\n35:            put(\"severity\", if (decision == ProviderAcceptanceDecision.ACCEPTED && priced) \"INFO\" else \"WARNING\")\n36:            put(\"event\", \"analysis_provider_assessment\")\n37:            put(\"usagePriced\", priced)\n38:            put(\"acceptanceDecision\", decision.name)\n39:            put(\"reasonCode\", if (decision == ProviderAcceptanceDecision.VALIDATION_REJECTED) \"FINAL_ACCEPTANCE_VALIDATION\"\n44:    private fun nativeFields(number: Int, nativeRequestHash: String, evidence: NativeGenerationEvidence): LinkedHashMap<String, Any?> {\n47:            \"provider\" to evidence.provider.name,\n49:            \"outcome\" to evidence.outcome.name, \"httpStatus\" to evidence.httpStatus?.takeIf { it in 100..599 },\n50:            \"providerRequestId\" to evidence.providerRequestId?.takeIf(requestId::matches),\n51:            \"providerErrorType\" to evidence.providerErrorType?.let { if (it in nativeErrors) it else \"UNRECOGNIZED\" },\n63:            evidence.outcome == AnthropicOutcome.COMPLETE -> if (priced) null else \"USAGE_UNPRICED\"","is_error":false},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016Jy9a3ptBNFPdjNjsr418E","type":"tool_result","content":"=== serviços e jobs\r\nastrologo-paid\r\nastrologo-paid-internal\r\nanthropic-wif-probe\r\nastrologo-paid-deletion\r\nastrologo-paid-runner\r\nop-provisioning-sync\r\nopenai-wif-probe\r\n=== amostra de logs recentes (eventos) 24h\r\n\r\nCount Name\r\n----- ----\r\n  292 appcheck\tVerified\t\t\r\n  102 payment_reconciliation_deferred\t\t\t\r\n    3 analysis_provider_assessment\tCOMPLETE\tGOOGLE\t\r\n    3 analysis_provider_returned\tCOMPLETE\tGOOGLE","is_error":false}]}}
