d` and `X-Tracking-Id` from `MercadoPagoConfig`, the same values `MercadoPagoClient.addDefaultHeaders` adds to the SDK-serialized creation; reads, cancellations, refunds and searches went out without them. Motivated by the \"SDK do backend\" recommendation on the integration-quality panel (97/100, 30/10/2026).\n3. Tests: `unpaidOrderTheProviderNoLongerKnowsIsAbandonedInsteadOfDeferredForever` (404 → ABANDONED; 429/500/503 → deferred) and `everyProviderCallCarriesTheOfficialSdkIdentification`.\n\n## App and Play listing (1.0.0, versionCode 21)\n\n1. `versionCode 21`, `versionName \"1.0.0\"`; CHANGELOG `[1.0.0] — 30/10/2026`; README.\n2. `play/listings/{pt-BR,en-US}/listing.json`: product presentation (short 78 chars, full 2758/2693 chars; no payment provider or price named). `play/release-notes`: the product presentation (394 chars each).\n3. `play/listings/graphics/phone/01..08.png`: eight new phone screenshots from the real debug app on `pixel_10_api37`, pt-BR, 1080×1800 24-bit RGB (status bar cropped): home, natal wheel, planets and houses, readings, free element library, transits, synastry, locality map. `play/README.md` records them. A merge does not send them to Play; the Play Developer API update follows the merge.\n\n## Local gates (30/10/2026, JDK 27+35, PowerShell)\n\n| Gate | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `:app:assembleDebug :app:assembleDebugAndroidTest` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 20s |\n| `:app:lintDebug :app:lintRelease` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 5m 39s |\n| `testDebugUnitTest :backend:test :core:analysis:test` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 1m 33s |\n\n## After merge\n\nOne `deploy-backend.yml` run; listing texts and screenshots via the Play Developer API; `publish-play.yml` on the production track for 1.0.0 (21).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","changed_files":22,"comments":6,"commits":4,"created_at":"2026-10-30T04:22:49Z","deletions":21,"draft":false,"head":{"ref":"claude/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers","repo":{"description":"Aplicativo Android