{"parentUuid":"f0f25d3d-90f5-45f1-be47-6996691438fc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-mythos-5-1","id":"msg_011CgXpX6MySpg88K3MT2G7A","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LZ6JGTn42kL2eVSAm9DKmP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers && python -X utf8 -I - <<'PYEOF'\np='temp/pr-body.md'; s=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\ns=s.replace(\"whose authoritative read answers a definitive 4xx (not 429) and that holds no entitlement moves to `ABANDONED` (`manualCase PROVIDER_RESOURCE_MISSING`, `nextRereadAt` null). New `observeMissing` hook; `V2Host` logs `payment_order_missing_at_provider`. 429 and 5xx stay transient.\",\n \"whose authoritative read answers a confirmed `404 order_not_found` and that holds no entitlement moves to `ABANDONED` (`manualCase PROVIDER_RESOURCE_MISSING`, `nextRereadAt` null). New `observeMissing` hook; `V2Host` logs `payment_order_missing_at_provider`. Every other failure, including 400/401/403 from our own credential, stays transient and is deferred (review of 30/10/2026: Codex, Claude bot, Entire trail 223).\")\ns=s.replace(\"3. Tests: `unpaidOrderTheProviderNoLongerKnowsIsAbandonedInsteadOfDeferredForever` (404 → ABANDONED; 429/500/503 → deferred) and `everyProviderCallCarriesTheOfficialSdkIdentification`.\",\n \"3. **`push_send_failed` event.** `ExecutionMessaging.send` swallowed every FCM error other than UNREGISTERED/INVALID_ARGUMENT; it now prints a structured WARNING (type, error code; no account, device or reference) counted by the native log-based metric `astrologo_push_send_failed`.\\n4. Tests: `unpaidOrderTheProviderNoLongerKnowsIsAbandonedInsteadOfDeferredForever` (404 order_not_found → ABANDONED; 429/500/503/400/401/403, bare 404 and 404 with another code → deferred) and `everyProviderCallCarriesTheOfficialSdkIdentification`.\")\ns=s.replace(\"A merge does not send them to Play; the Play Developer API update follows the merge.\",\n \"A merge does not send them to Play; the listing texts and the eight screenshots were sent through the Play Developer API on 30/10/2026 01:26 (edit `02188369212095457261`, pt-BR and en-US).\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"| `:app:assembleDebug :app:assembleDebugAndroidTest` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 20s |\n| `:app:lintDebug :app:lintRelease` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 5m 39s |\n| `testDebugUnitTest :backend:test :core:analysis:test` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 1m 33s |\"\"\",\n\"\"\"| `:app:assembleDebug :app:assembleDebugAndroidTest` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL (rebased tree, 01:44) |\n| `:app:lintDebug :app:lintRelease` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL (rebased tree, 01:44) |\n| `testDebugUnitTest :backend:test :core:analysis:test` | BUILD SUCCESSFUL (rebased tree, 01:44); `:backend:test` again after the push event, 1m 14s |\n\n## Native observability configured on 30/10/2026 (GCP project, no code)\n\nSeven log-based metrics (`astrologo_mp_webhook_outcome`, `astrologo_payment_reconciliation_deferred`, `astrologo_payment_reconciliation_failure`, `astrologo_payment_order_missing_at_provider`, `astrologo_provider_assessment`, `astrologo_preparation_capacity_exceeded`, `astrologo_push_send_failed`) and eleven Cloud Monitoring alert policies on the existing Slack channel \"GCP Alerts\": webhook failures, repeated reconciliations (stuck orders or refunds), sweep failure, 404 abandonment, provider attempt not accepted, cascade activation (Anthropic/OpenAI), preparation capacity, push not delivered, backend 5xx (`run.googleapis.com/request_count`), runner execution failed (`job/completed_execution_count`), generation stuck (`job/running_executions` > 90 min). Recorded in LCV-464.\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"## After merge\\n\\nOne `deploy-backend.yml` run; listing texts and screenshots via the Play Developer API; `publish-play.yml` on the production track for 1.0.0 (21).\",\n \"## After merge\\n\\nOne `deploy-backend.yml` run; `publish-play.yml` on the production track for 1.0.0 (21). A draft app only accepts `draft` on production through the API; the first public rollout (and its staged percentage) is completed in the Play Console by the operator.\")\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='\\n').write(s); print('ok', 'order_not_found' in s, 'push_send_failed' in s)\nPYEOF\ncat > /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/pr-edit-170.ps1 <<'EOF'\n$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\nSet-Location 'C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers'\ngh pr edit 170 --repo LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android --body-file temp/pr-body.md 2>&1 | Out-String\ngh pr view 170 --repo LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android --json headRefOid,mergeStateStatus,labels --jq '{headRefOid,mergeStateStatus,labels:[.labels[].name]}'\nEOF\ncd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations && python -X utf8 -I tools/op-terminal/opx.py --terminal default --timeout 120 --shell pwsh --cwd C:/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations -f temp/pr-edit-170.ps1 2>&1 | tail -4","description":"Atualiza o corpo da PR #170 com a regra final, o evento de push, a ficha já enviada e a observabilidade","timeout":180000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3444,"cache_read_input_tokens":394621,"output_tokens":4780,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":558},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3444,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":4780,"cache_read_input_tokens":394621,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3444,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3444},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01LZ6JGTn42kL2eVSAm9DKmP":{"command":"cd