{"parentUuid":"8e50937f-125b-4bf1-935a-e3dda5ddd501","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ca7f7a62-2c98-4c13-acad-efff44eb1c51","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EgFvEGwGkRyCzZfLUjNEwN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"results\":[{\"content\":\"\\n* [HTTP request](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.HTTP_TEMPLATE)\\n* [Path parameters](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.PATH_PARAMETERS)\\n* [Request body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.request_body)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.request_body.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [Response body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.response_body)\\n* [Authorization scopes](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.aspect)\\n* [AppStoreAppDetails](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppDetails)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppDetails.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [AppStoreAppStoreListing](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppStoreListing)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppStoreListing.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [AppStoreAppActiveApks](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApks)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApks.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [AppStoreAppActiveApkSet](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApkSet)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApkSet.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyStringResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyStringResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyStringResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicySingleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicySingleChoiceResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicySingleChoiceResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyGroupResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyGroupResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [Group](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#Group)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#Group.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [NestedPolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#NestedPolicyResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#NestedPolicyResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyBooleanResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyBooleanResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyBooleanResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyDocumentResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyDocumentResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyDocumentResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyKeyedGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyKeyedGroupResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyKeyedGroupResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [KeyedGroup](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#KeyedGroup)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#KeyedGroup.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [Try it!](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#try-it)\\n\\nUpdates details for an app hosted on an app store. Use this to provide details for a new app, or to update details for an existing app. The update will be sent for review immediately after creation.\\n\\n### HTTP request\\n\\nPOST https://androidpublisher.googleapis.com/androidpublisher/v3/appstore/{appStorePackageName}/apps:update The URL uses\\n[gRPC Transcoding](https://google.aip.dev/127)syntax.\\n\\n### Path parameters\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Parameters |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| appStorePackageName | string Required. Package name of the third-party app store. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n### Request body\\n\\nThe request body contains data with the following structure: JSON representation { \\\"packageName\\\": string, \\\"appDetails\\\": { object (AppStoreAppDetails) }, \\\"activeLocalizedStoreListings\\\": [ { object (AppStoreAppStoreListing) } ], \\\"activeApks\\\": { object (AppStoreAppActiveApks) }, \\\"policyDeclarations\\\": [ { object (AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration) } ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| packageName | string Required. Package name of the app. |\\n| appDetails | object (\\n[AppStoreAppDetails](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppDetails)) Required. General developer details for the app. |\\n| activeLocalizedStoreListings[] | object (\\n[AppStoreAppStoreListing](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppStoreListing)) Required. Localized store listings details of the update. |\\n| activeApks | object (\\n[AppStoreAppActiveApks](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApks)) Required. Actively distributed APKs of the app. |\\n| policyDeclarations[] | object (\\n[AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration)) Required. Policy declarations provided for the app. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n### Response body\\n\\nIf successful, the response body is empty.\\n\\n### Authorization scopes\\n\\nRequires the following OAuth scope:\\n\\n* https://www.googleapis.com/auth/androidpublisher\\n\\n\\n\\n## AppStoreAppDetails\\n\\nDetails about the app. JSON representation { \\\"developerName\\\": string, \\\"contactEmail\\\": string, \\\"developerWebsite\\\": string }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| developerName | string Required. The app developer's name. |\\n| contactEmail | string Required. The app developer's contact email address. |\\n| developerWebsite | string Optional. Website link for the developer or app. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\",\"id\":\"c1\",\"parent\":\"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp\"},{\"content\":\"## AppStoreAppStoreListing\\n\\nA localized store listing. These are the details about the app as shown in your app store. JSON representation { \\\"languageCode\\\": string, \\\"appName\\\": string, \\\"fullDescription\\\": string, \\\"shortDescription\\\": string, \\\"appIconId\\\": string, \\\"screenshotId\\\": [ string ], \\\"videoLink\\\": string }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| languageCode | string Required. Language code (e.g., \\\"en-US\\\") of the listing. |\\n| appName | string Required. The title of the app. |\\n| fullDescription | string Required. Comprehensive description text about the app. |\\n| shortDescription | string Optional. Quick summary about the app. |\\n| appIconId | string Required. Image ID generated from appstoreappsreview.uploadimage for the main app icon. |\\n| screenshotId[] | string Required. Multiple image IDs for screenshot galleries. |\\n| videoLink | string Optional. Link to a video about the app. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## AppStoreAppActiveApks\\n\\nInformation about active APKs of an app store hosted app. JSON representation { \\\"activeApkSets\\\": [ { object (AppStoreAppActiveApkSet) } ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| activeApkSets[] | object (\\n[AppStoreAppActiveApkSet](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApkSet)) Required. List specifying which APK sets are distributed together. This list should contain all APKs that you're distributing for this app. Add an entry for each individual installable set of APKs. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## AppStoreAppActiveApkSet\\n\\nAn installable set of active APKs. All APKs in this set should belong to the same version of the app. A set of APKs might only contain 1 APK if the app in question publishes using APKs. If the app uses app bundles (or a similar technology), this set should contain all APKs (even optional ones) that might be installed for this app. A set of APKs should be installable together. If certain APKs are exclusive to one another and cannot be installed together, then a separate AppStoreAppActiveApkSet should be created. JSON representation { \\\"baseApkId\\\": string, \\\"splitApkId\\\": [ string ], \\\"versionCode\\\": string, \\\"alreadyPublishedOnPlay\\\": boolean }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| baseApkId | string Required. The ID for the main base application module. Example: base.apk or app.apk. |\\n| splitApkId[] | string Optional. IDs for split modules that might be installed in combination with the base APK. Can be empty if app bundles (or a similar technology) are not used. Example: config.en.apk. |\\n| versionCode | string (\\n[int64](https://developers.google.com/discovery/v1/type-format)format) Optional. Version code for the version this APK set represents. |\\n| alreadyPublishedOnPlay | boolean Optional. Whether all APKs referenced in this active APK set are published on Play Store (or derived from an app bundle published on Play Store). When this is set, versionCode must be provided. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration\\n\\nA policy declaration with its responses. JSON representation { \\\"declarationId\\\": string, \\\"responses\\\": [ { object (PolicyResponse) } ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| declarationId | string Required. ID of the policy declaration. |\\n| responses[] | object (\\n[PolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyResponse)) Required. Responses provided for this declaration. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\",\"id\":\"c2\",\"parent\":\"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp\"},{\"content\":\"\\n* [HTTP request](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.HTTP_TEMPLATE)\\n* [Path parameters](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.PATH_PARAMETERS)\\n* [Request body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.request_body)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.request_body.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [Response body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.response_body)\\n* [Authorization scopes](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.aspect)\\n* [AppStoreAppPublishState](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#AppStoreAppPublishState)\\n* [Try it!](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#try-it)\\n\\nUpdates the publish status of an app store hosted app. The default state after calling appstoreappsreview.updateappstorehostedapp is PUBLISHED. It is not necessary to call this RPC explicitly to set an app to PUBLISHED.\\n\\n### HTTP request\\n\\nPOST https://androidpublisher.googleapis.com/androidpublisher/v3/appstore/{appStorePackageName}/apps/{packageName}:updateAppStoreHostedAppPublishStatus The URL uses\\n[gRPC Transcoding](https://google.aip.dev/127)syntax.\\n\\n### Path parameters\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Parameters |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| appStorePackageName | string Required. Package name of the third-party app store. |\\n| packageName | string Required. Package name of the app. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n### Request body\\n\\nThe request body contains data with the following structure: JSON representation { \\\"publishState\\\": enum (AppStoreAppPublishState) }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| publishState | enum (\\n[AppStoreAppPublishState](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#AppStoreAppPublishState)) Required. The new publish state for the hosted app. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n### Response body\\n\\nIf successful, the response body is empty.\\n\\n### Authorization scopes\\n\\nRequires the following OAuth scope:\\n\\n* https://www.googleapis.com/auth/androidpublisher\\n\\n\\n\\n## AppStoreAppPublishState\\n\\nThe publish state of a hosted app.\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Enums |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_UNSPECIFIED | Unspecified publish state. Do not use. |\\n| APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_PUBLISHED | The app is published and available on the third-party app store. |\\n| APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_UNPUBLISHED | The app is unpublished and no longer available on the third-party app store. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\",\"id\":\"c1\",\"parent\":\"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus\"},{\"content\":\"\\n* questionId (string, Required): The unique identifier for the specific question being answered (e.g., POLICY_QUESTION_ID_FINANCIAL_PRODUCT_TYPES , POLICY_QUESTION_ID_TAC_TARGET_AGE_GROUPS ).\\n* value (Required): The answer itself, which can be one of the following types:\\n\\n    * booleanResponse : For Yes or No questions.\\n\\n        * value (boolean)\\n\\n\\n    * stringResponse : For plain text answers, including URLs.\\n\\n        * value (string)\\n\\n\\n    * singleChoiceResponse : When only one option can be selected from a list.\\n\\n        * value (string): The ID of the chosen response choice.\\n\\n\\n    * multipleChoiceResponse : When multiple options can be selected.\\n\\n        * values (Array of string): The IDs of the chosen response choices.\\n\\n\\n    * documentResponse : For questions requiring a document upload. See\\n[Handling Document Uploads](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/app-store-review#handling-document-uploads).\\n    * groupResponse : For repeating sets of nested questions.\\n    * keyedGroupResponse : For sets of nested questions grouped by a specific key.\\n\\n\\n\\nFor example snippets for declaration, refer to the\\n[detailed guide](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/app-store-review/policy-declarations).Handling Document UploadsSome policy questions require you to provide supporting documents (e.g., licenses for Financial Features). Documents cannot be embedded directly in the\\n[UpdateAppStoreHostedAppRequest](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp). Instead, you must:\\n\\n* Upload the Document: Use the\\n[UploadAppStoreAppPolicyDeclarationFile](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/uploadappstoreapppolicydeclarationfile)endpoint. This is a media upload request. The fileType should be set to DECLARATION_FILE_TYPE_DOCUMENT .\\n\\n    * Endpoint: POST /androidpublisher/v3/appstore/{appStorePackageName}/apps/{packageName}/policyDeclarationFiles:upload\\n    * Successful upload responses will include a fileId .\\n\\n\\n* Reference the Document ID: In the PolicyResponse for the document question, use the documentResponse type. Populate the documentId field with the fileId obtained from the upload step.\\n\\nPolicyDocumentResponse Object:\\n\\n* documentId (string, Required): The ID returned from the\\n[UploadAppStoreAppPolicyDeclarationFile](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/uploadappstoreapppolicydeclarationfile)endpoint.\\n* expiryDate (Date, Optional): The expiry date of the document, if applicable.\\n* nonExpiring (boolean, Optional): Set to true if the document does not expire.\\n\\nExample for Document Response: // Inside a PolicyResponse object { \\\"questionId\\\": \\\"POLICY_QUESTION_ID_FINANCE_CRYPTO_US_FINCEN_LICENSE\\\", // Example ID \\\"documentResponse\\\": { \\\"documentId\\\": \\\"123456789\\\", // The fileId from upload \\\"expiryDate\\\": { \\\"year\\\": 2027, \\\"month\\\": 6, \\\"day\\\": 1 } } }\\n\\n## 4. Controlling availability\\n\\nOnce you commit the hosted app state using\\n[UpdateAppStoreHostedApp](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp), the app is automatically processed and marked as published by default in Google Play for the third-party app store. To control the app's availability after it has been committed, call the\\n[updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus)method to update its state:\\n\\n* Unpublishing an App : To make the hosted app unavailable, set the publishState field to APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_UNPUBLISHED .\\n* Re-publishing an App : To make a previously unpublished app available again without modifying listings or re-uploading assets, set the publishState field to APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_PUBLISHED .\\n\\n\",\"id\":\"c4\",\"parent\":\"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/app-store-review\"},{\"content\":\"## PolicyResponse\\n\\nAn individual response (answer) to a policy question about an app. JSON representation { \\\"questionId\\\": string, // The following is a list of mutually exclusive fields. At most one of the // fields will be set in a response: \\\"stringResponse\\\": { object (PolicyStringResponse) }, \\\"singleChoiceResponse\\\": { object (PolicySingleChoiceResponse) }, \\\"multipleChoiceResponse\\\": { object (PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse) }, \\\"groupResponse\\\": { object (PolicyGroupResponse) }, \\\"keyedGroupResponse\\\": { object (PolicyKeyedGroupResponse) }, \\\"booleanResponse\\\": { object (PolicyBooleanResponse) }, \\\"documentResponse\\\": { object (PolicyDocumentResponse) } // End of mutually exclusive fields. }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| questionId | string Required. ID of the question being answered. |\\n| Specific response value. The following is a list of mutually exclusive fields. At most one of the fields will be set in a response: |  |\\n| stringResponse | object (\\n[PolicyStringResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyStringResponse)) Optional. A string response. |\\n| singleChoiceResponse | object (\\n[PolicySingleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicySingleChoiceResponse)) Optional. A single choice response. |\\n| multipleChoiceResponse | object (\\n[PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse)) Optional. A multiple choice response. |\\n| groupResponse | object (\\n[PolicyGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyGroupResponse)) Optional. A group response. |\\n| keyedGroupResponse | object (\\n[PolicyKeyedGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyKeyedGroupResponse)) Optional. A keyed group response. |\\n| booleanResponse | object (\\n[PolicyBooleanResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyBooleanResponse)) Optional. A boolean response. |\\n| documentResponse | object (\\n[PolicyDocumentResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyDocumentResponse)) Optional. A document response. |\\n| End of mutually exclusive fields. |  |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## PolicyStringResponse\\n\\nAny response best encoded as a string. Includes URLs and multiline text fields. JSON representation { \\\"value\\\": string }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| value | string Required. Provided string value. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## PolicySingleChoiceResponse\\n\\nAny response where a single option is chosen from several possibilities. JSON representation { \\\"value\\\": string }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| value | string Required. Provided value. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse\\n\\nAny response where multiple options can be chosen from several possibilities. JSON representation { \\\"values\\\": [ string ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| values[] | string Optional. Provided values. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## PolicyGroupResponse\\n\\nA repeated group of responses. JSON representation { \\\"groups\\\": [ { object (Group) } ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| groups[] | object (\\n[Group](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#Group)) Optional. Groups of responses to questions. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## Group\\n\\nA group of responses. JSON representation { \\\"responses\\\": [ { object (NestedPolicyResponse) } ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| responses[] | object (\\n[NestedPolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#NestedPolicyResponse)) Required. Responses within a group. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\",\"id\":\"c3\",\"parent\":\"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp\"}]}"}]},"uuid":"7d38065c-4dc2-4711-9ed2-0201efad1ca6","timestamp":"2026-10-30T04:55:35.143Z","toolUseResult":"{\"results\":[{\"content\":\"\\n* [HTTP request](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.HTTP_TEMPLATE)\\n* [Path parameters](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.PATH_PARAMETERS)\\n* [Request body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.request_body)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.request_body.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [Response body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.response_body)\\n* [Authorization scopes](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.aspect)\\n* [AppStoreAppDetails](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppDetails)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppDetails.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [AppStoreAppStoreListing](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppStoreListing)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppStoreListing.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [AppStoreAppActiveApks](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApks)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApks.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [AppStoreAppActiveApkSet](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApkSet)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApkSet.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyStringResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyStringResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyStringResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicySingleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicySingleChoiceResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicySingleChoiceResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyGroupResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyGroupResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [Group](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#Group)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#Group.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [NestedPolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#NestedPolicyResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#NestedPolicyResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyBooleanResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyBooleanResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyBooleanResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyDocumentResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyDocumentResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyDocumentResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [PolicyKeyedGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyKeyedGroupResponse)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyKeyedGroupResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [KeyedGroup](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#KeyedGroup)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#KeyedGroup.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [Try it!](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#try-it)\\n\\nUpdates details for an app hosted on an app store. Use this to provide details for a new app, or to update details for an existing app. The update will be sent for review immediately after creation.\\n\\n### HTTP request\\n\\nPOST https://androidpublisher.googleapis.com/androidpublisher/v3/appstore/{appStorePackageName}/apps:update The URL uses\\n[gRPC Transcoding](https://google.aip.dev/127)syntax.\\n\\n### Path parameters\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Parameters |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| appStorePackageName | string Required. Package name of the third-party app store. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n### Request body\\n\\nThe request body contains data with the following structure: JSON representation { \\\"packageName\\\": string, \\\"appDetails\\\": { object (AppStoreAppDetails) }, \\\"activeLocalizedStoreListings\\\": [ { object (AppStoreAppStoreListing) } ], \\\"activeApks\\\": { object (AppStoreAppActiveApks) }, \\\"policyDeclarations\\\": [ { object (AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration) } ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| packageName | string Required. Package name of the app. |\\n| appDetails | object (\\n[AppStoreAppDetails](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppDetails)) Required. General developer details for the app. |\\n| activeLocalizedStoreListings[] | object (\\n[AppStoreAppStoreListing](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppStoreListing)) Required. Localized store listings details of the update. |\\n| activeApks | object (\\n[AppStoreAppActiveApks](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApks)) Required. Actively distributed APKs of the app. |\\n| policyDeclarations[] | object (\\n[AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration)) Required. Policy declarations provided for the app. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n### Response body\\n\\nIf successful, the response body is empty.\\n\\n### Authorization scopes\\n\\nRequires the following OAuth scope:\\n\\n* https://www.googleapis.com/auth/androidpublisher\\n\\n\\n\\n## AppStoreAppDetails\\n\\nDetails about the app. JSON representation { \\\"developerName\\\": string, \\\"contactEmail\\\": string, \\\"developerWebsite\\\": string }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| developerName | string Required. The app developer's name. |\\n| contactEmail | string Required. The app developer's contact email address. |\\n| developerWebsite | string Optional. Website link for the developer or app. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\",\"id\":\"c1\",\"parent\":\"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp\"},{\"content\":\"## AppStoreAppStoreListing\\n\\nA localized store listing. These are the details about the app as shown in your app store. JSON representation { \\\"languageCode\\\": string, \\\"appName\\\": string, \\\"fullDescription\\\": string, \\\"shortDescription\\\": string, \\\"appIconId\\\": string, \\\"screenshotId\\\": [ string ], \\\"videoLink\\\": string }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| languageCode | string Required. Language code (e.g., \\\"en-US\\\") of the listing. |\\n| appName | string Required. The title of the app. |\\n| fullDescription | string Required. Comprehensive description text about the app. |\\n| shortDescription | string Optional. Quick summary about the app. |\\n| appIconId | string Required. Image ID generated from appstoreappsreview.uploadimage for the main app icon. |\\n| screenshotId[] | string Required. Multiple image IDs for screenshot galleries. |\\n| videoLink | string Optional. Link to a video about the app. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## AppStoreAppActiveApks\\n\\nInformation about active APKs of an app store hosted app. JSON representation { \\\"activeApkSets\\\": [ { object (AppStoreAppActiveApkSet) } ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| activeApkSets[] | object (\\n[AppStoreAppActiveApkSet](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApkSet)) Required. List specifying which APK sets are distributed together. This list should contain all APKs that you're distributing for this app. Add an entry for each individual installable set of APKs. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## AppStoreAppActiveApkSet\\n\\nAn installable set of active APKs. All APKs in this set should belong to the same version of the app. A set of APKs might only contain 1 APK if the app in question publishes using APKs. If the app uses app bundles (or a similar technology), this set should contain all APKs (even optional ones) that might be installed for this app. A set of APKs should be installable together. If certain APKs are exclusive to one another and cannot be installed together, then a separate AppStoreAppActiveApkSet should be created. JSON representation { \\\"baseApkId\\\": string, \\\"splitApkId\\\": [ string ], \\\"versionCode\\\": string, \\\"alreadyPublishedOnPlay\\\": boolean }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| baseApkId | string Required. The ID for the main base application module. Example: base.apk or app.apk. |\\n| splitApkId[] | string Optional. IDs for split modules that might be installed in combination with the base APK. Can be empty if app bundles (or a similar technology) are not used. Example: config.en.apk. |\\n| versionCode | string (\\n[int64](https://developers.google.com/discovery/v1/type-format)format) Optional. Version code for the version this APK set represents. |\\n| alreadyPublishedOnPlay | boolean Optional. Whether all APKs referenced in this active APK set are published on Play Store (or derived from an app bundle published on Play Store). When this is set, versionCode must be provided. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration\\n\\nA policy declaration with its responses. JSON representation { \\\"declarationId\\\": string, \\\"responses\\\": [ { object (PolicyResponse) } ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| declarationId | string Required. ID of the policy declaration. |\\n| responses[] | object (\\n[PolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyResponse)) Required. Responses provided for this declaration. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\",\"id\":\"c2\",\"parent\":\"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp\"},{\"content\":\"\\n* [HTTP request](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.HTTP_TEMPLATE)\\n* [Path parameters](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.PATH_PARAMETERS)\\n* [Request body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.request_body)\\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.request_body.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\\n\\n\\n* [Response body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.response_body)\\n* [Authorization scopes](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.aspect)\\n* [AppStoreAppPublishState](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#AppStoreAppPublishState)\\n* [Try it!](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#try-it)\\n\\nUpdates the publish status of an app store hosted app. The default state after calling appstoreappsreview.updateappstorehostedapp is PUBLISHED. It is not necessary to call this RPC explicitly to set an app to PUBLISHED.\\n\\n### HTTP request\\n\\nPOST https://androidpublisher.googleapis.com/androidpublisher/v3/appstore/{appStorePackageName}/apps/{packageName}:updateAppStoreHostedAppPublishStatus The URL uses\\n[gRPC Transcoding](https://google.aip.dev/127)syntax.\\n\\n### Path parameters\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Parameters |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| appStorePackageName | string Required. Package name of the third-party app store. |\\n| packageName | string Required. Package name of the app. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n### Request body\\n\\nThe request body contains data with the following structure: JSON representation { \\\"publishState\\\": enum (AppStoreAppPublishState) }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| publishState | enum (\\n[AppStoreAppPublishState](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#AppStoreAppPublishState)) Required. The new publish state for the hosted app. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n### Response body\\n\\nIf successful, the response body is empty.\\n\\n### Authorization scopes\\n\\nRequires the following OAuth scope:\\n\\n* https://www.googleapis.com/auth/androidpublisher\\n\\n\\n\\n## AppStoreAppPublishState\\n\\nThe publish state of a hosted app.\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Enums |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_UNSPECIFIED | Unspecified publish state. Do not use. |\\n| APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_PUBLISHED | The app is published and available on the third-party app store. |\\n| APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_UNPUBLISHED | The app is unpublished and no longer available on the third-party app store. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\",\"id\":\"c1\",\"parent\":\"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus\"},{\"content\":\"\\n* questionId (string, Required): The unique identifier for the specific question being answered (e.g., POLICY_QUESTION_ID_FINANCIAL_PRODUCT_TYPES , POLICY_QUESTION_ID_TAC_TARGET_AGE_GROUPS ).\\n* value (Required): The answer itself, which can be one of the following types:\\n\\n    * booleanResponse : For Yes or No questions.\\n\\n        * value (boolean)\\n\\n\\n    * stringResponse : For plain text answers, including URLs.\\n\\n        * value (string)\\n\\n\\n    * singleChoiceResponse : When only one option can be selected from a list.\\n\\n        * value (string): The ID of the chosen response choice.\\n\\n\\n    * multipleChoiceResponse : When multiple options can be selected.\\n\\n        * values (Array of string): The IDs of the chosen response choices.\\n\\n\\n    * documentResponse : For questions requiring a document upload. See\\n[Handling Document Uploads](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/app-store-review#handling-document-uploads).\\n    * groupResponse : For repeating sets of nested questions.\\n    * keyedGroupResponse : For sets of nested questions grouped by a specific key.\\n\\n\\n\\nFor example snippets for declaration, refer to the\\n[detailed guide](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/app-store-review/policy-declarations).Handling Document UploadsSome policy questions require you to provide supporting documents (e.g., licenses for Financial Features). Documents cannot be embedded directly in the\\n[UpdateAppStoreHostedAppRequest](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp). Instead, you must:\\n\\n* Upload the Document: Use the\\n[UploadAppStoreAppPolicyDeclarationFile](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/uploadappstoreapppolicydeclarationfile)endpoint. This is a media upload request. The fileType should be set to DECLARATION_FILE_TYPE_DOCUMENT .\\n\\n    * Endpoint: POST /androidpublisher/v3/appstore/{appStorePackageName}/apps/{packageName}/policyDeclarationFiles:upload\\n    * Successful upload responses will include a fileId .\\n\\n\\n* Reference the Document ID: In the PolicyResponse for the document question, use the documentResponse type. Populate the documentId field with the fileId obtained from the upload step.\\n\\nPolicyDocumentResponse Object:\\n\\n* documentId (string, Required): The ID returned from the\\n[UploadAppStoreAppPolicyDeclarationFile](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/uploadappstoreapppolicydeclarationfile)endpoint.\\n* expiryDate (Date, Optional): The expiry date of the document, if applicable.\\n* nonExpiring (boolean, Optional): Set to true if the document does not expire.\\n\\nExample for Document Response: // Inside a PolicyResponse object { \\\"questionId\\\": \\\"POLICY_QUESTION_ID_FINANCE_CRYPTO_US_FINCEN_LICENSE\\\", // Example ID \\\"documentResponse\\\": { \\\"documentId\\\": \\\"123456789\\\", // The fileId from upload \\\"expiryDate\\\": { \\\"year\\\": 2027, \\\"month\\\": 6, \\\"day\\\": 1 } } }\\n\\n## 4. Controlling availability\\n\\nOnce you commit the hosted app state using\\n[UpdateAppStoreHostedApp](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp), the app is automatically processed and marked as published by default in Google Play for the third-party app store. To control the app's availability after it has been committed, call the\\n[updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus)method to update its state:\\n\\n* Unpublishing an App : To make the hosted app unavailable, set the publishState field to APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_UNPUBLISHED .\\n* Re-publishing an App : To make a previously unpublished app available again without modifying listings or re-uploading assets, set the publishState field to APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_PUBLISHED .\\n\\n\",\"id\":\"c4\",\"parent\":\"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/app-store-review\"},{\"content\":\"## PolicyResponse\\n\\nAn individual response (answer) to a policy question about an app. JSON representation { \\\"questionId\\\": string, // The following is a list of mutually exclusive fields. At most one of the // fields will be set in a response: \\\"stringResponse\\\": { object (PolicyStringResponse) }, \\\"singleChoiceResponse\\\": { object (PolicySingleChoiceResponse) }, \\\"multipleChoiceResponse\\\": { object (PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse) }, \\\"groupResponse\\\": { object (PolicyGroupResponse) }, \\\"keyedGroupResponse\\\": { object (PolicyKeyedGroupResponse) }, \\\"booleanResponse\\\": { object (PolicyBooleanResponse) }, \\\"documentResponse\\\": { object (PolicyDocumentResponse) } // End of mutually exclusive fields. }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| questionId | string Required. ID of the question being answered. |\\n| Specific response value. The following is a list of mutually exclusive fields. At most one of the fields will be set in a response: |  |\\n| stringResponse | object (\\n[PolicyStringResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyStringResponse)) Optional. A string response. |\\n| singleChoiceResponse | object (\\n[PolicySingleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicySingleChoiceResponse)) Optional. A single choice response. |\\n| multipleChoiceResponse | object (\\n[PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse)) Optional. A multiple choice response. |\\n| groupResponse | object (\\n[PolicyGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyGroupResponse)) Optional. A group response. |\\n| keyedGroupResponse | object (\\n[PolicyKeyedGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyKeyedGroupResponse)) Optional. A keyed group response. |\\n| booleanResponse | object (\\n[PolicyBooleanResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyBooleanResponse)) Optional. A boolean response. |\\n| documentResponse | object (\\n[PolicyDocumentResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyDocumentResponse)) Optional. A document response. |\\n| End of mutually exclusive fields. |  |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## PolicyStringResponse\\n\\nAny response best encoded as a string. Includes URLs and multiline text fields. JSON representation { \\\"value\\\": string }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| value | string Required. Provided string value. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## PolicySingleChoiceResponse\\n\\nAny response where a single option is chosen from several possibilities. JSON representation { \\\"value\\\": string }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| value | string Required. Provided value. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse\\n\\nAny response where multiple options can be chosen from several possibilities. JSON representation { \\\"values\\\": [ string ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| values[] | string Optional. Provided values. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## PolicyGroupResponse\\n\\nA repeated group of responses. JSON representation { \\\"groups\\\": [ { object (Group) } ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| groups[] | object (\\n[Group](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#Group)) Optional. Groups of responses to questions. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\\n\\n## Group\\n\\nA group of responses. JSON representation { \\\"responses\\\": [ { object (NestedPolicyResponse) } ] }\\n\\n_START_OF_TABLE_\\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\\n| Fields |  |\\n|-|-|\\n| responses[] | object (\\n[NestedPolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#NestedPolicyResponse)) Required. Responses within a group. |\\n\\n_END_OF_TABLE_\\n\",\"id\":\"c3\",\"parent\":\"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp\"}]}","mcpMeta":{"structuredContent":{"results":[{"content":"\n* [HTTP request](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.HTTP_TEMPLATE)\n* [Path parameters](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.PATH_PARAMETERS)\n* [Request body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.request_body)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.request_body.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [Response body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.response_body)\n* [Authorization scopes](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#body.aspect)\n* [AppStoreAppDetails](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppDetails)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppDetails.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [AppStoreAppStoreListing](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppStoreListing)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppStoreListing.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [AppStoreAppActiveApks](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApks)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApks.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [AppStoreAppActiveApkSet](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApkSet)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApkSet.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [PolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyResponse)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [PolicyStringResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyStringResponse)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyStringResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [PolicySingleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicySingleChoiceResponse)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicySingleChoiceResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [PolicyGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyGroupResponse)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyGroupResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [Group](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#Group)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#Group.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [NestedPolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#NestedPolicyResponse)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#NestedPolicyResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [PolicyBooleanResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyBooleanResponse)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyBooleanResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [PolicyDocumentResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyDocumentResponse)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyDocumentResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [PolicyKeyedGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyKeyedGroupResponse)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyKeyedGroupResponse.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [KeyedGroup](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#KeyedGroup)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#KeyedGroup.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [Try it!](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#try-it)\n\nUpdates details for an app hosted on an app store. Use this to provide details for a new app, or to update details for an existing app. The update will be sent for review immediately after creation.\n\n### HTTP request\n\nPOST https://androidpublisher.googleapis.com/androidpublisher/v3/appstore/{appStorePackageName}/apps:update The URL uses\n[gRPC Transcoding](https://google.aip.dev/127)syntax.\n\n### Path parameters\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Parameters |  |\n|-|-|\n| appStorePackageName | string Required. Package name of the third-party app store. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n### Request body\n\nThe request body contains data with the following structure: JSON representation { \"packageName\": string, \"appDetails\": { object (AppStoreAppDetails) }, \"activeLocalizedStoreListings\": [ { object (AppStoreAppStoreListing) } ], \"activeApks\": { object (AppStoreAppActiveApks) }, \"policyDeclarations\": [ { object (AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration) } ] }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| packageName | string Required. Package name of the app. |\n| appDetails | object (\n[AppStoreAppDetails](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppDetails)) Required. General developer details for the app. |\n| activeLocalizedStoreListings[] | object (\n[AppStoreAppStoreListing](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppStoreListing)) Required. Localized store listings details of the update. |\n| activeApks | object (\n[AppStoreAppActiveApks](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApks)) Required. Actively distributed APKs of the app. |\n| policyDeclarations[] | object (\n[AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration)) Required. Policy declarations provided for the app. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n### Response body\n\nIf successful, the response body is empty.\n\n### Authorization scopes\n\nRequires the following OAuth scope:\n\n* https://www.googleapis.com/auth/androidpublisher\n\n\n\n## AppStoreAppDetails\n\nDetails about the app. JSON representation { \"developerName\": string, \"contactEmail\": string, \"developerWebsite\": string }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| developerName | string Required. The app developer's name. |\n| contactEmail | string Required. The app developer's contact email address. |\n| developerWebsite | string Optional. Website link for the developer or app. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n","id":"c1","parent":"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp"},{"content":"## AppStoreAppStoreListing\n\nA localized store listing. These are the details about the app as shown in your app store. JSON representation { \"languageCode\": string, \"appName\": string, \"fullDescription\": string, \"shortDescription\": string, \"appIconId\": string, \"screenshotId\": [ string ], \"videoLink\": string }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| languageCode | string Required. Language code (e.g., \"en-US\") of the listing. |\n| appName | string Required. The title of the app. |\n| fullDescription | string Required. Comprehensive description text about the app. |\n| shortDescription | string Optional. Quick summary about the app. |\n| appIconId | string Required. Image ID generated from appstoreappsreview.uploadimage for the main app icon. |\n| screenshotId[] | string Required. Multiple image IDs for screenshot galleries. |\n| videoLink | string Optional. Link to a video about the app. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n## AppStoreAppActiveApks\n\nInformation about active APKs of an app store hosted app. JSON representation { \"activeApkSets\": [ { object (AppStoreAppActiveApkSet) } ] }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| activeApkSets[] | object (\n[AppStoreAppActiveApkSet](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#AppStoreAppActiveApkSet)) Required. List specifying which APK sets are distributed together. This list should contain all APKs that you're distributing for this app. Add an entry for each individual installable set of APKs. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n## AppStoreAppActiveApkSet\n\nAn installable set of active APKs. All APKs in this set should belong to the same version of the app. A set of APKs might only contain 1 APK if the app in question publishes using APKs. If the app uses app bundles (or a similar technology), this set should contain all APKs (even optional ones) that might be installed for this app. A set of APKs should be installable together. If certain APKs are exclusive to one another and cannot be installed together, then a separate AppStoreAppActiveApkSet should be created. JSON representation { \"baseApkId\": string, \"splitApkId\": [ string ], \"versionCode\": string, \"alreadyPublishedOnPlay\": boolean }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| baseApkId | string Required. The ID for the main base application module. Example: base.apk or app.apk. |\n| splitApkId[] | string Optional. IDs for split modules that might be installed in combination with the base APK. Can be empty if app bundles (or a similar technology) are not used. Example: config.en.apk. |\n| versionCode | string (\n[int64](https://developers.google.com/discovery/v1/type-format)format) Optional. Version code for the version this APK set represents. |\n| alreadyPublishedOnPlay | boolean Optional. Whether all APKs referenced in this active APK set are published on Play Store (or derived from an app bundle published on Play Store). When this is set, versionCode must be provided. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n## AppStoreAppPolicyDeclaration\n\nA policy declaration with its responses. JSON representation { \"declarationId\": string, \"responses\": [ { object (PolicyResponse) } ] }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| declarationId | string Required. ID of the policy declaration. |\n| responses[] | object (\n[PolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyResponse)) Required. Responses provided for this declaration. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n","id":"c2","parent":"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp"},{"content":"\n* [HTTP request](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.HTTP_TEMPLATE)\n* [Path parameters](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.PATH_PARAMETERS)\n* [Request body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.request_body)\n    * [JSON representation](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.request_body.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION)\n\n\n* [Response body](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.response_body)\n* [Authorization scopes](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#body.aspect)\n* [AppStoreAppPublishState](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#AppStoreAppPublishState)\n* [Try it!](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#try-it)\n\nUpdates the publish status of an app store hosted app. The default state after calling appstoreappsreview.updateappstorehostedapp is PUBLISHED. It is not necessary to call this RPC explicitly to set an app to PUBLISHED.\n\n### HTTP request\n\nPOST https://androidpublisher.googleapis.com/androidpublisher/v3/appstore/{appStorePackageName}/apps/{packageName}:updateAppStoreHostedAppPublishStatus The URL uses\n[gRPC Transcoding](https://google.aip.dev/127)syntax.\n\n### Path parameters\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Parameters |  |\n|-|-|\n| appStorePackageName | string Required. Package name of the third-party app store. |\n| packageName | string Required. Package name of the app. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n### Request body\n\nThe request body contains data with the following structure: JSON representation { \"publishState\": enum (AppStoreAppPublishState) }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| publishState | enum (\n[AppStoreAppPublishState](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus#AppStoreAppPublishState)) Required. The new publish state for the hosted app. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n### Response body\n\nIf successful, the response body is empty.\n\n### Authorization scopes\n\nRequires the following OAuth scope:\n\n* https://www.googleapis.com/auth/androidpublisher\n\n\n\n## AppStoreAppPublishState\n\nThe publish state of a hosted app.\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Enums |  |\n|-|-|\n| APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_UNSPECIFIED | Unspecified publish state. Do not use. |\n| APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_PUBLISHED | The app is published and available on the third-party app store. |\n| APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_UNPUBLISHED | The app is unpublished and no longer available on the third-party app store. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n","id":"c1","parent":"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus"},{"content":"\n* questionId (string, Required): The unique identifier for the specific question being answered (e.g., POLICY_QUESTION_ID_FINANCIAL_PRODUCT_TYPES , POLICY_QUESTION_ID_TAC_TARGET_AGE_GROUPS ).\n* value (Required): The answer itself, which can be one of the following types:\n\n    * booleanResponse : For Yes or No questions.\n\n        * value (boolean)\n\n\n    * stringResponse : For plain text answers, including URLs.\n\n        * value (string)\n\n\n    * singleChoiceResponse : When only one option can be selected from a list.\n\n        * value (string): The ID of the chosen response choice.\n\n\n    * multipleChoiceResponse : When multiple options can be selected.\n\n        * values (Array of string): The IDs of the chosen response choices.\n\n\n    * documentResponse : For questions requiring a document upload. See\n[Handling Document Uploads](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/app-store-review#handling-document-uploads).\n    * groupResponse : For repeating sets of nested questions.\n    * keyedGroupResponse : For sets of nested questions grouped by a specific key.\n\n\n\nFor example snippets for declaration, refer to the\n[detailed guide](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/app-store-review/policy-declarations).Handling Document UploadsSome policy questions require you to provide supporting documents (e.g., licenses for Financial Features). Documents cannot be embedded directly in the\n[UpdateAppStoreHostedAppRequest](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp). Instead, you must:\n\n* Upload the Document: Use the\n[UploadAppStoreAppPolicyDeclarationFile](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/uploadappstoreapppolicydeclarationfile)endpoint. This is a media upload request. The fileType should be set to DECLARATION_FILE_TYPE_DOCUMENT .\n\n    * Endpoint: POST /androidpublisher/v3/appstore/{appStorePackageName}/apps/{packageName}/policyDeclarationFiles:upload\n    * Successful upload responses will include a fileId .\n\n\n* Reference the Document ID: In the PolicyResponse for the document question, use the documentResponse type. Populate the documentId field with the fileId obtained from the upload step.\n\nPolicyDocumentResponse Object:\n\n* documentId (string, Required): The ID returned from the\n[UploadAppStoreAppPolicyDeclarationFile](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/uploadappstoreapppolicydeclarationfile)endpoint.\n* expiryDate (Date, Optional): The expiry date of the document, if applicable.\n* nonExpiring (boolean, Optional): Set to true if the document does not expire.\n\nExample for Document Response: // Inside a PolicyResponse object { \"questionId\": \"POLICY_QUESTION_ID_FINANCE_CRYPTO_US_FINCEN_LICENSE\", // Example ID \"documentResponse\": { \"documentId\": \"123456789\", // The fileId from upload \"expiryDate\": { \"year\": 2027, \"month\": 6, \"day\": 1 } } }\n\n## 4. Controlling availability\n\nOnce you commit the hosted app state using\n[UpdateAppStoreHostedApp](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp), the app is automatically processed and marked as published by default in Google Play for the third-party app store. To control the app's availability after it has been committed, call the\n[updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapppublishstatus)method to update its state:\n\n* Unpublishing an App : To make the hosted app unavailable, set the publishState field to APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_UNPUBLISHED .\n* Re-publishing an App : To make a previously unpublished app available again without modifying listings or re-uploading assets, set the publishState field to APP_STORE_APP_PUBLISH_STATE_PUBLISHED .\n\n","id":"c4","parent":"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/app-store-review"},{"content":"## PolicyResponse\n\nAn individual response (answer) to a policy question about an app. JSON representation { \"questionId\": string, // The following is a list of mutually exclusive fields. At most one of the // fields will be set in a response: \"stringResponse\": { object (PolicyStringResponse) }, \"singleChoiceResponse\": { object (PolicySingleChoiceResponse) }, \"multipleChoiceResponse\": { object (PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse) }, \"groupResponse\": { object (PolicyGroupResponse) }, \"keyedGroupResponse\": { object (PolicyKeyedGroupResponse) }, \"booleanResponse\": { object (PolicyBooleanResponse) }, \"documentResponse\": { object (PolicyDocumentResponse) } // End of mutually exclusive fields. }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| questionId | string Required. ID of the question being answered. |\n| Specific response value. The following is a list of mutually exclusive fields. At most one of the fields will be set in a response: |  |\n| stringResponse | object (\n[PolicyStringResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyStringResponse)) Optional. A string response. |\n| singleChoiceResponse | object (\n[PolicySingleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicySingleChoiceResponse)) Optional. A single choice response. |\n| multipleChoiceResponse | object (\n[PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse)) Optional. A multiple choice response. |\n| groupResponse | object (\n[PolicyGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyGroupResponse)) Optional. A group response. |\n| keyedGroupResponse | object (\n[PolicyKeyedGroupResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyKeyedGroupResponse)) Optional. A keyed group response. |\n| booleanResponse | object (\n[PolicyBooleanResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyBooleanResponse)) Optional. A boolean response. |\n| documentResponse | object (\n[PolicyDocumentResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#PolicyDocumentResponse)) Optional. A document response. |\n| End of mutually exclusive fields. |  |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n## PolicyStringResponse\n\nAny response best encoded as a string. Includes URLs and multiline text fields. JSON representation { \"value\": string }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| value | string Required. Provided string value. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n## PolicySingleChoiceResponse\n\nAny response where a single option is chosen from several possibilities. JSON representation { \"value\": string }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| value | string Required. Provided value. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n## PolicyMultipleChoiceResponse\n\nAny response where multiple options can be chosen from several possibilities. JSON representation { \"values\": [ string ] }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| values[] | string Optional. Provided values. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n## PolicyGroupResponse\n\nA repeated group of responses. JSON representation { \"groups\": [ { object (Group) } ] }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| groups[] | object (\n[Group](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#Group)) Optional. Groups of responses to questions. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n\n\n## Group\n\nA group of responses. JSON representation { \"responses\": [ { object (NestedPolicyResponse) } ] }\n\n_START_OF_TABLE_\nTABLE_IN_MARKDOWN:\n| Fields |  |\n|-|-|\n| responses[] | object (\n[NestedPolicyResponse](https://developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp#NestedPolicyResponse)) Required. Responses within a group. |\n\n_END_OF_TABLE_\n","id":"c3","parent":"documents/developers.google.com/android-publisher/api-ref/rest/v3/appstoreappsreview/updateappstorehostedapp"}]}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8e50937f-125b-4bf1-935a-e3dda5ddd501","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glistening-tumbling-prism"}
