draft app\\\"*. A documentação oficial descreve o caminho: a\"\n              echo \"primeira publicação se conclui no Play Console, e o botão **Release** publica\"\n              echo \"o aplicativo junto.\"\n              echo \"\"\n              echo \"A GitHub Release **não** foi gravada, porque a loja ainda não entrega este\"\n              echo \"binário. Depois que o aplicativo estiver publicado, as próximas publicações\"\n              echo \"usam \\`completed\\` e gravam a Release normalmente.\"\n            } >> \"$GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY\"\n            echo \"released=false\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n            exit 0\n          fi\n\n=== 100-112\n          missing=\"\"\n          for name in PLAY_PACKAGE_NAME WIF_PROVIDER PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT \\\n                      GCP_QUOTA_PROJECT KEYSTORE_B64 KEYSTORE_PASSWORD; do\n            if [ -z \"${!name}\" ]; then\n              missing=\"$missing $name\"\n            fi\n          done\n          if [ \"$TRACK\" = production ] && [ \"$RELEASE_STATUS\" = completed ] && [ -z \"$PLAY_RELEASE_TOKEN\" ]; then\n            missing=\"$missing PLAY_RELEASE_TOKEN\"\n          fi\n          if [ -n \"$missing\" ]; then\n            echo \"::error::Missing repository configuration:$missing. Variables are set\" \\\n                 \"under Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions.\"\n220:version and its Play publication date (supplied only by `publish-play.yml`),\n488:  The native quality-query rollout uses the explicit repository property\n536:- `publish-play.yml`, dispatched manually, builds the release App Bundle, sends\n543:  new\". A `release_status` input carries `completed` or `draft`: an app that has\n554:  also includes halted/resumable releases; Google controls current rollout and\n573:  the same keyless Workload Identity Federation as `publish-play.yml`. It sends","is_error":false}]}}
