{"parentUuid":"5d49e1e7-15d0-41a8-b159-a43b697d693c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-mythos-5-1","id":"msg_011CgXqcnah3CkqDTFuyVH3f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JMdhdVYRDDvgWuQRWTmvQe","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > temp/commit-msg-5.txt <<'EOF'\nNative staged rollout input, push_send_failed changelog, JDT resource note\n\n- publish-play.yml: `release_status: inProgress` with a `user_fraction`\n  input (0 < fraction < 1) follows the official \"Staged Rollouts\" workflow\n  (`userFraction` only with `inProgress`); the configuration step validates\n  the fraction, PLAY_RELEASE_TOKEN is required for every non-draft\n  production run, and the GitHub Release steps run for completed and\n  inProgress alike (both are served to users). README follows. Operator\n  decision of 30/10/2026 (LCV-464).\n- CHANGELOG [1.0.0]: bullets for `push_send_failed` (Entire trail 223\n  finding 01M65J9NQ17T) and for the staged rollout input.\n- GeminiSingleExchangeTransport: `@SuppressWarnings(\"resource\")` with the\n  ownership note on the bounded body; Eclipse JDT flagged a leak that does\n  not exist (closing the returned ResponseBody closes the bounded stream).\n\nRefs LCV-464\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ncat > /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/commit-170-5.ps1 <<'EOF'\n$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\nSet-Location 'C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers'\ngit add -- .github/workflows/publish-play.yml CHANGELOG.md README.md backend/src/main/java/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/provider/GeminiSingleExchangeTransport.java\ngit commit -q -F temp/commit-msg-5.txt\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"git commit falhou\" }\ngit push origin claude/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers 2>&1 | Out-String\nif ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"git push falhou\" }\ngit log -1 --format='%H %G? %s'\nentire session attach 3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88 --fo