{"parentUuid":"360cd45c-7c17-47af-bd09-8cd7480b137a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c8ca4fd5-39f8-4a65-b4cd-ccf88ffaf89e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"gh/LCV-Ideas-Software/-/trails/223/changes/astrologo-android/16 com finding.\n\n<pasted_content id=\"7066\">\n### Low finding\n\n**Location:** `backend/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/universalorders/UniversalOrderService.kt:335-339`\n\n`observeMissing(failure)` runs before `store.mutate`, and the V2Host observer always writes `outcome: ABANDONED`. When the CAS sees `saved != order` (a concurrent webhook or grant changed the row), the order is not abandoned, but the log, and any metric built on it, still reports that it was. Call the observer only when the mutate actually applied the transition, or drop the hard-coded outcome.\n</pasted_content id=\"7066\">\n"}]},"uuid":"74e1b8b9-5b9b-4d02-876b-2193bbf1e021","timestamp":"2026-10-30T05:18:14.830Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":401,"turnIndex":649},"turnAttributionKey":"REDACTED","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\github-operations","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glistening-tumbling-prism"}
