{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","hash":"3fa884b695fd76dda6f14e8ba10298e22bad3cf5ec4be938a17bbbcba6ebeb96","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Teste verde com o caso de concorrência. Rodo o portão completo de testes do backend, preparo o commit e, em paralelo, resolvo o finding do Entire."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PYuq2BHnpWCav8QBMNmhon","name":"PowerShell","input":{"command":"Set-Location 'C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers'; $env:JAVA_HOME='C:\\Users\\lcvle\\tools\\jdk-27+35'; $env:Path=\"$env:JAVA_HOME\\bin;$env:Path\"; .\\gradlew.bat :backend:test --console=plain 2>&1 | Select-String -CaseSensitive '^e: |BUILD (SUCCESSFUL|FAILED)|FAILED' | ForEach-Object { $_.Line }","description":"Roda a suíte completa do backend após a correção do observador","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TAbEorBEfiHQxjeBcj9PtS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers && cat > temp/commit-msg-6.txt <<'EOF'\nReport payment_order_missing_at_provider only when the CAS abandoned the order\n\nEntire trail 223 finding 01M65KM7ZH4W: observeMissing ran before\nstore.mutate, so a row changed concurrently (webhook or grant between the\nread and the CAS) was logged as ABANDONED although nothing was abandoned.\nThe observer now runs only when the mutate applied the transition; the\ntest adds the concurrent-accreditation case (row stays PAID, no event).\n\nRefs LCV-464\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\nsed -e 's#temp/commit-msg-5.txt#temp/commit-msg-6.txt#' -e 's#git add -- .*#git add -- backend/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/universalorders/UniversalOrderService.kt backend/src/test/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/universalorders/UniversalOrderServiceTest.kt#' /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/commit-170-5.ps1 > /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/commit-170-6.ps1; grep -n 'git add\\|commit-msg' /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/commit-170-6.ps1; entire trail finding resolve 223 01M65KM7ZH4W --repo gh/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android -m \"Fixed in the next commit: store.mutate runs first and observeMissing fires only when the returned row is ABANDONED with manualCase PROVIDER_RESOURCE_MISSING; test covers a row accredited concurrently during the read (stays PAID, no event).\" 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Prepara a mensagem e o script do commit e resolve o finding do Entire","timeout":90000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
