{"parentUuid":"2aab3d0c-1ac0-4a39-8980-07c6c4394357","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a5e6dd6c-ceae-449b-b51b-6f105e63d7f8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"gh/LCV-Ideas-Software/-/trails/223/changes/astrologo-android/16 com findings.\n\n<pasted_content id=\"7066\">\n### Low finding\n\n**Location:** `backend/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/payments/MercadoPagoOrders.kt:269-276`\n\n`request()` now always sets `User-Agent`, `X-Product-Id` and `X-Tracking-Id` from `MercadoPagoConfig`. The checkout client still filters those same three headers out of the SDK request and passes them back in as `sdkHeaders` (line 155), where `setHeader` overwrites them with identical values. That leaves two mechanisms that do one job. Drop the `sdkHeaders` parameter and the filter, or keep only one source of truth.\n</pasted_content id=\"7066\">\n"}]},"uuid":"1ace6ab2-7961-41b9-a09f-fe1d77107c38","timestamp":"2026-10-30T05:24:18.928Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":402,"turnIndex":650},"turnAttributionKey":"REDACTED","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\github-operations","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glistening-tumbling-prism"}
