{"parentUuid":"4afe74f3-f749-4316-86b3-5c148c86cd5d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-mythos-5-1","id":"msg_011CgXs7N5iLhQ8kzFAPE5qk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QZeNvygtbQ78nLj2smMbhS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python -X utf8 -I - <<'PYEOF'\nt='backend/src/test/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/payments/NativeMercadoPagoOrdersTest.kt'; s=open(t,encoding='utf-8').read()\nold='''                \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123\" -> 200 to orderJson\n                \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123/cancel\" -> 200 to \"{}\"\n                else -> error(\"Unexpected provider request\")\n            }\n        }\n        val provider = NativeMercadoPagoOrders(\"fixture-token\", config, http = http)\n        provider.read(\"ORDTST123\"); provider.cancel(\"ORDTST123\")\n        assertEquals(setOf(\"/users/me\", \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123\", \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123/cancel\"), seen.keys)'''\nnew='''                \"/v1/orders\" -> 201 to orderJson\n                \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123\" -> 200 to orderJson\n                \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123/cancel\" -> 200 to \"{}\"\n                else -> error(\"Unexpected provider request\")\n            }\n        }\n        val provider = NativeMercadoPagoOrders(\"fixture-token\", config, http = http)\n        // The SDK-serialized creation goes through the same request(): one source of truth for the identification.\n        provider.create(\"a\".repeat(64), \"b\".repeat(64), payer); provider.read(\"ORDTST123\"); provider.cancel(\"ORDTST123\")\n        assertEquals(setOf(\"/users/me\", \"/v1/orders\", \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123\", \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123/cancel\"), seen.keys)'''\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new); open(t,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='\\n').write(s); print('test patched')\nPYEOF\ncat > temp/commit-msg-7.txt <<'EOF'\nOne source of truth for the Mercado Pago SDK identification headers\n\nEntire trail 223 finding: request() already sets User-Agent, X-Product-Id\nand X-Tracking-Id from MercadoPagoConfig, so the checkout client no longer\nfilters the SDK's copies back in through a sdkHeaders parameter. The header\ntest now also exercises the SDK-serialized creation (POST /v1/orders).\n\nRefs LCV-464\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\nsed -e 's#temp/commit-msg-6.txt#temp/commit-msg-7.txt#' -e 's#git add -- .*#git add -- backend/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/payments/MercadoPagoOrders.kt backend/src/test/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/payments/NativeMercadoPagoOrdersTest.kt#' /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/commit-170-6.ps1 > /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/commit-170-7.ps1; echo prepared; entire trail finding list 223 --repo gh/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android 2>&1 | awk 'NR>1{print $1, $3, $4}'","description":"Estende o teste dos cabeçalhos à criação, prepara o commit e lista o ID do finding aberto","timeout":90000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1799,"cache_read_input_tokens":542022,"output_tokens":1514,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1799,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":1514,"cache_read_input_tokens":542022,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1799,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1799},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01QZeNvygtbQ78nLj2smMbhS":{"command":"cd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers && python -X utf8 -I - <<'PYEOF'\nt='backend/src/test/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/payments/Nati