{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","hash":"7928b582dac348d7deb90ce2abc697fb958899c35932574a2bbbc2830c7af022","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QZeNvygtbQ78nLj2smMbhS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/.worktrees/mp-sweep-404-sdk-headers && python -X utf8 -I - <<'PYEOF'\nt='backend/src/test/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/payments/NativeMercadoPagoOrdersTest.kt'; s=open(t,encoding='utf-8').read()\nold='''                \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123\" -> 200 to orderJson\n                \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123/cancel\" -> 200 to \"{}\"\n                else -> error(\"Unexpected provider request\")\n            }\n        }\n        val provider = NativeMercadoPagoOrders(\"fixture-token\", config, http = http)\n        provider.read(\"ORDTST123\"); provider.cancel(\"ORDTST123\")\n        assertEquals(setOf(\"/users/me\", \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123\", \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123/cancel\"), seen.keys)'''\nnew='''                \"/v1/orders\" -> 201 to orderJson\n                \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123\" -> 200 to orderJson\n                \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123/cancel\" -> 200 to \"{}\"\n                else -> error(\"Unexpected provider request\")\n            }\n        }\n        val provider = NativeMercadoPagoOrders(\"fixture-token\", config, http = http)\n        // The SDK-serialized creation goes through the same request(): one source of truth for the identification.\n        provider.create(\"a\".repeat(64), \"b\".repeat(64), payer); provider.read(\"ORDTST123\"); provider.cancel(\"ORDTST123\")\n        assertEquals(setOf(\"/users/me\", \"/v1/orders\", \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123\", \"/v1/orders/ORDTST123/cancel\"), seen.keys)'''\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new); open(t,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='\\n').write(s); print('test patched')\nPYEOF\ncat > temp/commit-msg-7.txt <<'EOF'\nOne source of truth for the Mercado Pago SDK identification headers\n\nEntire trail 223 finding: request() already sets User-Agent, X-Product-Id\nand X-Tracking-Id from MercadoPagoConfig, so the checkout client no longer\nfilters the SDK's copies back in through a sdkHeaders parameter. The header\ntest now also exercises the SDK-serialized creation (POST /v1/orders).\n\nRefs LCV-464\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\nsed -e 's#temp/commit-msg-6.txt#temp/commit-msg-7.txt#' -e 's#git add -- .*#git add -- backend/src/main/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/payments/MercadoPagoOrders.kt backend/src/test/kotlin/dev/lcv/astrologo/backend/payments/NativeMercadoPagoOrdersTest.kt#' /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/commit-170-6.ps1 > /c/Users/lcvle/lcv-workspace/github-operations/temp/commit-170-7.ps1; echo prepared; entire trail finding list 223 --repo gh/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android 2>&1 | awk 'NR>1{print $1, $3, $4}'","description":"Estende o teste dos cabeçalhos à criação, prepara o commit e lista o ID do finding aberto","timeout":90000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HRqQ6EsAva1noe4uXAnU6v","name":"PowerShell","input":{"command":"Get-CimInstance Win32_Process | Where-Object { $_.CommandLine -match 'pr checks 170' } | ForEach-Object { Stop-Process -Id $_.ProcessId -Force; \"encerrado gh $($_.ProcessId)\" }; \"ok\"","description":"Encerra qualquer gh pr checks remanescente no terminal","timeout":60000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
