{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","prNumber":170,"prUrl":"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android/pull/170","prRepository":"LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android","timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:38:03.348Z"}
{"parentUuid":"9769f472-1be7-45b1-a45a-2b177b109a6d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6e39e5fa-2f32-4b18-a7c1-d9503ae803cb","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YW1hCT4CFHkdgHTVbi2qwt","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"method\":\"list_workflow_runs\",\"workflow_runs\":{\"total_count\":25,\"workflow_runs\":[{\"actor\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4\",\"id\":268063598,\"login\":\"lcv-leo\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/lcv-leo\"},\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-30T02:52:17Z\",\"display_title\":\"Deploy paid backend\",\"event\":\"workflow_dispatch\",\"head_branch\":\"main\",\"head_commit\":{\"message\":\"Read Mercado Pago orders without a settled paid amount, log deferred reconciliation, resolve CodeQL alerts (0.3.17) (#168)\\n\\nThe official \\\"Get order by ID\\\" reference declares total_paid_amount and\\ntransactions.payments[].paid_amount optional. The operator's real web\\norder of 29/10/2026 came back with one canceled card attempt and neither\\nfield; parseOrder required both whenever a transaction existed, so every\\nread failed as MpUnavailable from 21h38 on: the webhook answered 503\\ntwice, the reconciliation sweep deferred the order every minute without a\\ntrace, and the browser kept polling an order that never changed state.\\n\\n- parseOrder: an absent amount reads as zero for orders and payments whose\\n  money has not settled (created, action_required, processing, failed,\\n  canceled); processed, refunded and charged_back keep requiring it. An\\n  absent amount can never grant: the grant needs the exact accredited sum.\\n- UniversalOrderService: an observeDeferral hook, fed by V2Host as a\\n  structured payment_reconciliation_deferred stdout event (item kind,\\n  error type, provider status or contract code; no order reference).\\n- MpWebhookService: a PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE outcome before the 503.\\n- CodeQL (29/10/2026): the locality fixture test asserts the geometry left\\n  out exceeds a megabyte instead of a comparison its own bounds implied;\\n  the stage native-count invariant is checked without an unused binding;\\n  the dead originalPieces computation leaves verifyProviderRevisions.\\n- Version 0.3.17 (20); CHANGELOG, README and Play release notes.\\n\\nRefs LCV-464\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"},\"head_sha\":\"4a3a06eb606870b8d67c7939dd9cab6c75a02593\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android/actions/runs/40994169235\",\"id\":40994169235,\"name\":\"Deploy paid backend\",\"path\":\".github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml\",\"run_attempt\":1,\"run_number\":25,\"run_started_at\":\"2026-10-30T02:52:17Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"triggering_actor\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4\",\"id\":268063598,\"login\":\"lcv-leo\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/lcv-leo\"},\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-30T03:01:06Z\",\"workflow_id\":393281258},{\"actor\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4\",\"id\":268063598,\"login\":\"lcv-leo\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/lcv-leo\"},\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-29T22:47:50Z\",\"display_title\":\"Deploy paid backend\",\"event\":\"workflow_dispatch\",\"head_branch\":\"main\",\"head_commit\":{\"message\":\"Point the backend Dockerfiles at the official Temurin 25.0.5+8 Alpine image (#167)\\n\\n* Point the backend Dockerfiles at the official Temurin 25.0.5+8 Alpine image\\n\\nThe runtime digest the HTTP and job Dockerfiles consumed (runtime-audit\\n@18e25de9) was deleted on 29/10/2026 while closing a Security Command Center\\nfinding, after checking only Cloud Run services, jobs and revisions; the\\ndeployment of 29/10/2026 then failed at FROM with \\\"manifest unknown\\\".\\n\\nDocker Hub published the official eclipse-temurin:25.0.5_8-jre-alpine-3.24\\nimage on 29/10/2026 (it did not exist on 27/10, hence the manual JRE recipe).\\nIts linux/amd64 manifest a5ae9049 is now mirrored unchanged by digest into the\\nCMEK registry (Cloud Build d7117f5a, gcrane copy). Inside it: Alpine 3.24.3,\\nbrotli-libs 1.2.1-r0, openssl 3.5.9-r0, Temurin-25.0.5+8 (Cloud Build\\n08ee1ed5). Artifact Analysis finished with no vulnerability occurrences.\\n\\nThe provenance README documents the new mirror recipe, the incident and the\\ncheck to run before deleting any registry image; Dockerfile.runtime names the\\nupstream digest and no longer modifies the image.\\n\\nRefs LCV-464, #123.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64QBAXH8ZR8GJB4B4R2EAYD\\n\\n* Keep the runtime provenance reproducible: cloudbuild.yaml mirror recipe\\n\\nEntire trail 196 findings: the CHANGELOG entry gains its blank line; the\\nprovenance README keeps only reproducible facts (upstream digest, measured\\npackage versions, scan requirement) and sends the run narrative to the\\nchangelog and LCV-464; the comment-only Dockerfile.runtime is replaced by\\nbackend/container/cloudbuild.yaml, a runnable gcrane copy step.\\n\\nRefs LCV-464, #123.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64QVCRX4ZF5B3H92RPMZWKB\\n\\n* Name the logs bucket in the mirror Cloud Build config\\n\\nA user-managed build service account requires a user-owned logsBucket with\\nGCS_ONLY logging; the config now sets it to the deployment workflow's build-log\\nlocation and the README command names the build service account (Codex review\\nof #167).\\n\\nRefs LCV-464.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64RPG7KNE9ZJXFGMSHX66FR\\n\\n* Pin gcrane by digest and point the README at the config header\\n\\nEntire trail 196 findings: the mirror step runs gcrane pinned by the digest\\nof its image index instead of the mutable latest tag (it runs as the\\nproduction build service account), and the README no longer repeats the\\ncommand and the logs-bucket explanation that cloudbuild.yaml's header holds.\\n\\nRefs LCV-464.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64SXQS35M7QMH504X8Q4AKV\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"},\"head_sha\":\"af814b0daaf8415237f04eaba7cbf8c1f0e3aea7\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android/actions/runs/40968553493\",\"id\":40968553493,\"name\":\"Deploy paid backend\",\"path\":\".github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml\",\"run_attempt\":1,\"run_number\":24,\"run_started_at\":\"2026-10-29T22:47:50Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"triggering_actor\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4\",\"id\":268063598,\"login\":\"lcv-leo\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/lcv-leo\"},\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-29T22:59:34Z\",\"workflow_id\":393281258}]}}"}]},"uuid":"182ef270-ca3c-4916-b281-8bcca8fc51f9","timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:38:04.909Z","toolUseResult":"{\"method\":\"list_workflow_runs\",\"workflow_runs\":{\"total_count\":25,\"workflow_runs\":[{\"actor\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4\",\"id\":268063598,\"login\":\"lcv-leo\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/lcv-leo\"},\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-30T02:52:17Z\",\"display_title\":\"Deploy paid backend\",\"event\":\"workflow_dispatch\",\"head_branch\":\"main\",\"head_commit\":{\"message\":\"Read Mercado Pago orders without a settled paid amount, log deferred reconciliation, resolve CodeQL alerts (0.3.17) (#168)\\n\\nThe official \\\"Get order by ID\\\" reference declares total_paid_amount and\\ntransactions.payments[].paid_amount optional. The operator's real web\\norder of 29/10/2026 came back with one canceled card attempt and neither\\nfield; parseOrder required both whenever a transaction existed, so every\\nread failed as MpUnavailable from 21h38 on: the webhook answered 503\\ntwice, the reconciliation sweep deferred the order every minute without a\\ntrace, and the browser kept polling an order that never changed state.\\n\\n- parseOrder: an absent amount reads as zero for orders and payments whose\\n  money has not settled (created, action_required, processing, failed,\\n  canceled); processed, refunded and charged_back keep requiring it. An\\n  absent amount can never grant: the grant needs the exact accredited sum.\\n- UniversalOrderService: an observeDeferral hook, fed by V2Host as a\\n  structured payment_reconciliation_deferred stdout event (item kind,\\n  error type, provider status or contract code; no order reference).\\n- MpWebhookService: a PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE outcome before the 503.\\n- CodeQL (29/10/2026): the locality fixture test asserts the geometry left\\n  out exceeds a megabyte instead of a comparison its own bounds implied;\\n  the stage native-count invariant is checked without an unused binding;\\n  the dead originalPieces computation leaves verifyProviderRevisions.\\n- Version 0.3.17 (20); CHANGELOG, README and Play release notes.\\n\\nRefs LCV-464\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"},\"head_sha\":\"4a3a06eb606870b8d67c7939dd9cab6c75a02593\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android/actions/runs/40994169235\",\"id\":40994169235,\"name\":\"Deploy paid backend\",\"path\":\".github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml\",\"run_attempt\":1,\"run_number\":25,\"run_started_at\":\"2026-10-30T02:52:17Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"triggering_actor\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4\",\"id\":268063598,\"login\":\"lcv-leo\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/lcv-leo\"},\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-30T03:01:06Z\",\"workflow_id\":393281258},{\"actor\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4\",\"id\":268063598,\"login\":\"lcv-leo\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/lcv-leo\"},\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-29T22:47:50Z\",\"display_title\":\"Deploy paid backend\",\"event\":\"workflow_dispatch\",\"head_branch\":\"main\",\"head_commit\":{\"message\":\"Point the backend Dockerfiles at the official Temurin 25.0.5+8 Alpine image (#167)\\n\\n* Point the backend Dockerfiles at the official Temurin 25.0.5+8 Alpine image\\n\\nThe runtime digest the HTTP and job Dockerfiles consumed (runtime-audit\\n@18e25de9) was deleted on 29/10/2026 while closing a Security Command Center\\nfinding, after checking only Cloud Run services, jobs and revisions; the\\ndeployment of 29/10/2026 then failed at FROM with \\\"manifest unknown\\\".\\n\\nDocker Hub published the official eclipse-temurin:25.0.5_8-jre-alpine-3.24\\nimage on 29/10/2026 (it did not exist on 27/10, hence the manual JRE recipe).\\nIts linux/amd64 manifest a5ae9049 is now mirrored unchanged by digest into the\\nCMEK registry (Cloud Build d7117f5a, gcrane copy). Inside it: Alpine 3.24.3,\\nbrotli-libs 1.2.1-r0, openssl 3.5.9-r0, Temurin-25.0.5+8 (Cloud Build\\n08ee1ed5). Artifact Analysis finished with no vulnerability occurrences.\\n\\nThe provenance README documents the new mirror recipe, the incident and the\\ncheck to run before deleting any registry image; Dockerfile.runtime names the\\nupstream digest and no longer modifies the image.\\n\\nRefs LCV-464, #123.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64QBAXH8ZR8GJB4B4R2EAYD\\n\\n* Keep the runtime provenance reproducible: cloudbuild.yaml mirror recipe\\n\\nEntire trail 196 findings: the CHANGELOG entry gains its blank line; the\\nprovenance README keeps only reproducible facts (upstream digest, measured\\npackage versions, scan requirement) and sends the run narrative to the\\nchangelog and LCV-464; the comment-only Dockerfile.runtime is replaced by\\nbackend/container/cloudbuild.yaml, a runnable gcrane copy step.\\n\\nRefs LCV-464, #123.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64QVCRX4ZF5B3H92RPMZWKB\\n\\n* Name the logs bucket in the mirror Cloud Build config\\n\\nA user-managed build service account requires a user-owned logsBucket with\\nGCS_ONLY logging; the config now sets it to the deployment workflow's build-log\\nlocation and the README command names the build service account (Codex review\\nof #167).\\n\\nRefs LCV-464.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64RPG7KNE9ZJXFGMSHX66FR\\n\\n* Pin gcrane by digest and point the README at the config header\\n\\nEntire trail 196 findings: the mirror step runs gcrane pinned by the digest\\nof its image index instead of the mutable latest tag (it runs as the\\nproduction build service account), and the README no longer repeats the\\ncommand and the logs-bucket explanation that cloudbuild.yaml's header holds.\\n\\nRefs LCV-464.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64SXQS35M7QMH504X8Q4AKV\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"},\"head_sha\":\"af814b0daaf8415237f04eaba7cbf8c1f0e3aea7\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android/actions/runs/40968553493\",\"id\":40968553493,\"name\":\"Deploy paid backend\",\"path\":\".github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml\",\"run_attempt\":1,\"run_number\":24,\"run_started_at\":\"2026-10-29T22:47:50Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"triggering_actor\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4\",\"id\":268063598,\"login\":\"lcv-leo\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/lcv-leo\"},\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-29T22:59:34Z\",\"workflow_id\":393281258}]}}","mcpMeta":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"github-mcp-server","title":"GitHub MCP Server","icons":[{"src":"data:image/png;base64,REDACTED","mimeType":"image/png","theme":"light"},{"src":"data:image/png;base64,REDACTED","mimeType":"image/png","theme":"dark"}],"version":"github-mcp-server/remote-59427b793443f88795375c20cd01d8e035ecca69"}},"structuredContent":{"method":"list_workflow_runs","workflow_runs":{"total_count":25,"workflow_runs":[{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4","id":268063598,"login":"lcv-leo","profile_url":"https://github.com/lcv-leo"},"conclusion":"success","created_at":"2026-10-30T02:52:17Z","display_title":"Deploy paid backend","event":"workflow_dispatch","head_branch":"main","head_commit":{"message":"Read Mercado Pago orders without a settled paid amount, log deferred reconciliation, resolve CodeQL alerts (0.3.17) (#168)\n\nThe official \"Get order by ID\" reference declares total_paid_amount and\ntransactions.payments[].paid_amount optional. The operator's real web\norder of 29/10/2026 came back with one canceled card attempt and neither\nfield; parseOrder required both whenever a transaction existed, so every\nread failed as MpUnavailable from 21h38 on: the webhook answered 503\ntwice, the reconciliation sweep deferred the order every minute without a\ntrace, and the browser kept polling an order that never changed state.\n\n- parseOrder: an absent amount reads as zero for orders and payments whose\n  money has not settled (created, action_required, processing, failed,\n  canceled); processed, refunded and charged_back keep requiring it. An\n  absent amount can never grant: the grant needs the exact accredited sum.\n- UniversalOrderService: an observeDeferral hook, fed by V2Host as a\n  structured payment_reconciliation_deferred stdout event (item kind,\n  error type, provider status or contract code; no order reference).\n- MpWebhookService: a PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE outcome before the 503.\n- CodeQL (29/10/2026): the locality fixture test asserts the geometry left\n  out exceeds a megabyte instead of a comparison its own bounds implied;\n  the stage native-count invariant is checked without an unused binding;\n  the dead originalPieces computation leaves verifyProviderRevisions.\n- Version 0.3.17 (20); CHANGELOG, README and Play release notes.\n\nRefs LCV-464\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>"},"head_sha":"4a3a06eb606870b8d67c7939dd9cab6c75a02593","html_url":"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android/actions/runs/40994169235","id":40994169235,"name":"Deploy paid backend","path":".github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml","run_attempt":1,"run_number":25,"run_started_at":"2026-10-30T02:52:17Z","status":"completed","triggering_actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4","id":268063598,"login":"lcv-leo","profile_url":"https://github.com/lcv-leo"},"updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:01:06Z","workflow_id":393281258},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4","id":268063598,"login":"lcv-leo","profile_url":"https://github.com/lcv-leo"},"conclusion":"success","created_at":"2026-10-29T22:47:50Z","display_title":"Deploy paid backend","event":"workflow_dispatch","head_branch":"main","head_commit":{"message":"Point the backend Dockerfiles at the official Temurin 25.0.5+8 Alpine image (#167)\n\n* Point the backend Dockerfiles at the official Temurin 25.0.5+8 Alpine image\n\nThe runtime digest the HTTP and job Dockerfiles consumed (runtime-audit\n@18e25de9) was deleted on 29/10/2026 while closing a Security Command Center\nfinding, after checking only Cloud Run services, jobs and revisions; the\ndeployment of 29/10/2026 then failed at FROM with \"manifest unknown\".\n\nDocker Hub published the official eclipse-temurin:25.0.5_8-jre-alpine-3.24\nimage on 29/10/2026 (it did not exist on 27/10, hence the manual JRE recipe).\nIts linux/amd64 manifest a5ae9049 is now mirrored unchanged by digest into the\nCMEK registry (Cloud Build d7117f5a, gcrane copy). Inside it: Alpine 3.24.3,\nbrotli-libs 1.2.1-r0, openssl 3.5.9-r0, Temurin-25.0.5+8 (Cloud Build\n08ee1ed5). Artifact Analysis finished with no vulnerability occurrences.\n\nThe provenance README documents the new mirror recipe, the incident and the\ncheck to run before deleting any registry image; Dockerfile.runtime names the\nupstream digest and no longer modifies the image.\n\nRefs LCV-464, #123.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64QBAXH8ZR8GJB4B4R2EAYD\n\n* Keep the runtime provenance reproducible: cloudbuild.yaml mirror recipe\n\nEntire trail 196 findings: the CHANGELOG entry gains its blank line; the\nprovenance README keeps only reproducible facts (upstream digest, measured\npackage versions, scan requirement) and sends the run narrative to the\nchangelog and LCV-464; the comment-only Dockerfile.runtime is replaced by\nbackend/container/cloudbuild.yaml, a runnable gcrane copy step.\n\nRefs LCV-464, #123.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64QVCRX4ZF5B3H92RPMZWKB\n\n* Name the logs bucket in the mirror Cloud Build config\n\nA user-managed build service account requires a user-owned logsBucket with\nGCS_ONLY logging; the config now sets it to the deployment workflow's build-log\nlocation and the README command names the build service account (Codex review\nof #167).\n\nRefs LCV-464.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64RPG7KNE9ZJXFGMSHX66FR\n\n* Pin gcrane by digest and point the README at the config header\n\nEntire trail 196 findings: the mirror step runs gcrane pinned by the digest\nof its image index instead of the mutable latest tag (it runs as the\nproduction build service account), and the README no longer repeats the\ncommand and the logs-bucket explanation that cloudbuild.yaml's header holds.\n\nRefs LCV-464.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64SXQS35M7QMH504X8Q4AKV\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>"},"head_sha":"af814b0daaf8415237f04eaba7cbf8c1f0e3aea7","html_url":"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android/actions/runs/40968553493","id":40968553493,"name