ucket with\\nGCS_ONLY logging; the config now sets it to the deployment workflow's build-log\\nlocation and the README command names the build service account (Codex review\\nof #167).\\n\\nRefs LCV-464.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64RPG7KNE9ZJXFGMSHX66FR\\n\\n* Pin gcrane by digest and point the README at the config header\\n\\nEntire trail 196 findings: the mirror step runs gcrane pinned by the digest\\nof its image index instead of the mutable latest tag (it runs as the\\nproduction build service account), and the README no longer repeats the\\ncommand and the logs-bucket explanation that cloudbuild.yaml's header holds.\\n\\nRefs LCV-464.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M64SXQS35M7QMH504X8Q4AKV\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Mythos 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"},\"head_sha\":\"af814b0daaf8415237f04eaba7cbf8c1f0e3aea7\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android/actions/runs/40968553493\",\"id\":40968553493,\"name\":\"Deploy paid backend\",\"path\":\".github/workflows/deploy-backend.yml\",\"run_attempt\":1,\"run_number\":24,\"run_started_at\":\"2026-10-29T22:47:50Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"triggering_actor\":{\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268063598?v=4\",\"id\":268063598,\"login\":\"lcv-leo\",\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/lcv-leo\"},\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-29T22:59:34Z\",\"workflow_id\":393281258}]}}"}]}}
