{"parentUuid":"cc163849-6567-4de6-8af0-f4a94e76971b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-mythos-5-1","id":"msg_011CgXyzuoKJAJoHabgv8G8o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Provas finais (30/10/2026, 03:53–03:55), registradas na LCV-464:\n\n1. **Produto `analise_ia`: resolvido, sem ação sua.** A API nova de monetização responde à conta de serviço: opção `padrao` **ACTIVE**, Brasil **AVAILABLE, BRL 89,99**, listagens pt-BR e en-US. O 403 era só do recurso legado `inappproducts`.\n2. **Conteúdo do app: só o Console lê.** Lista oficial completa da API (revisão 29/10/2026, 145 métodos; os 37 de `edits.*` impressos no registro): Data Safety só tem POST; não existe método para classificação IARC, público-alvo ou categoria. Resta a você só conferir essas páginas.\n3. **Lançamento: só o Console.** Numa edição de teste descartada, a API recusou `completed` (\"Only releases with status draft may be created on draft app\") e rollout gradual (\"Staged rollout is not permitted on draft app\").\n4. **Compra pelo canal Play.** O emulador `pixel_10_api37` é imagem `google_apis` com `PlayStore.enabled=no`: não tem Play Store nem Play Billing. A documentação oficial exige conta Google de testador de licença num aparelho com Play. **Pergunta formal:** existe alguma conta de testador de licença e um aparelho ou emulador com Play Store que eu possa usar? Se sim, eu executo e comprovo os 10 passos; se não, a compra é sua.\n5. **`github-operations\\temp\\op-terminal`** é o diretório de estado do próprio terminal opx (o código aponta `temp/op-terminal/<nome>`), criado em 29/10/2026 às 12:03, antes desta sessão; não é artefato meu e o terminal precisa dele.\n6. Pasta do worktree removida; `astrologo-android\\temp` não existe."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2058,"cache_read_input_tokens":671225,"output_tokens":655,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2058,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":655,"cache_read_input_tokens":671225,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2058,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2058},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgXyzu9sGYgEKroUhFAxn","requestRef":"db2ca096-39eb-411f-999f-2881d1f54d32","requestedModel":"claude-mythos-5-1","attributionMcpServer":"claude.ai Linear","attributionMcpTool":"save_comment","type":"assistant","uuid":"d590897c-140b-4a00-a8ac-3df9d2b54fc4","timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:55:22.934Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glistening-tumbling-prism"}
{"parentUuid":"d590897c-140b-4a00-a8ac-3df9d2b54fc4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5434d457-4713-42a2-bc42-a657b425207d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Any claims or assertions you make must be thoroughly and irrefutably proven or demonstrated! I require concrete, irrefutable evidence for anything you label as \"pending\" or \"inconclusive.\"\n\nAlways use the date and time formats standard in Brazil. Your internal communication should always take place in your native language, but when communicating with the operator, the use of Brazilian Portuguese is mandatory.\n\nIt is strictly forbidden to infer, presume, guess, hallucinate, fabricate, or make dec… [+3420 chars]]: Condição não satisfeita. Itens 'pendentes' ainda sem prova conclusiva: (1) a compra pelo canal Play permanece sem resposta do operador sobre a existência de conta de testador de licença/aparelho com Play Store, e o emulador pixel_10_api37 tem 'PlayStore.enabled=no'; (2) a leitura de 'Conteúdo do app' (IARC, público-alvo, categoria) é afirmada como só do Console com base na lista da API, sem consulta formal ao operador sobre alternativas; (3) o diretório 'github-operations\\temp\\op-terminal' é classificado como pré-existente e necessário, mas a exigência de que 'temp\\' seja apagado após a conclusão não foi cumprida nem justificada por consulta ao operador; (4) 'Lançamento' e 'Iniciar o lançamento' dependem de decisão do operador no Console, não de pesquisa registrada na pauta."},"isMeta":true,"uuid":"68b414e2-bb7f-47b2-95f6-05ddd1077eb3","timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:55:29.890Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glistening-tumbling-prism"}
{"parentUuid":"68b414e2-bb7f-47b2-95f6-05ddd1077eb3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"goal_status","met":false,"condition":"Any claims or assertions you make must be thoroughly and irrefutably proven or demonstrated! I require concrete, irrefutable evidence for anything you label as \"pending\" or \"inconclusive.\"\n\nAlways use the date and time formats standard in Brazil. Your internal communication should always take place in your native language, but when communicating with the operator, the use of Brazilian Portuguese is mandatory.\n\nIt is strictly forbidden to infer, presume, guess, hallucinate, fabricate, or make decisions on one’s own. In the absence of data or information, it is mandatory to actively consult official documentation, forums, communities, or the Internet Archive. If it is not possible to resolve a question using these resources, the operator must be consulted.\n\nThe redundancy of procedures is strictly prohibited, absent conclusive proof that such redundancy is absolutely necessary.\n\nThe `D:` drive no longer exists. Save any materials that would otherwise be stored in `audits\\`, `deliverables\\`, or `Outros-Trabalhos\\` into a `temp\\` directory within each repository you are working on. Once the task is complete, delete this `temp\\` folder entirely, ensuring that everything which needs to be—or can be—saved is uploaded to GitHub or Linear. Repository branches/worktrees must be created exclusively within `C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace\\.worktrees\\`. We follow a \"zero local retention\" policy: save everything that needs to be saved to Linear/GitHub, then delete it from your local machine. Assets, images, and designs may be kept in Figma or Canva, provided they are properly referenced and linked for easy retrieval.\n\nAll API credentials, keys and tokens are stored in 1Password. Open a single, persistent, hidden terminal session using `op run` and execute all commands that rely on these credentials, keys and tokens within that session.\n\nDedicate your full effort to \"deep research\" when seeking solutions to any problems encountered. Conduct an exhaustive, broad, and comprehensive investigation—consulting official documentation, forums, online communities, and the wider internet—before declaring any item as \"pending\" or a \"blocker.\" Before asking the operator for information you believe is missing, check existing records, chat logs, open/closed issues, etc.\n\nAlways prioritize the use of native, official solutions—whether from GitHub, Google, or Android (as applicable)—as well as those from approved, official third-party providers. Any resources required for the correct and fully functional implementation of these native, official, and approved solutions must be provided.\n\nAs a general rule, the use of custom modifications is prohibited. This policy may be relaxed on a case-by-case basis, subject to prior evaluation and approval by the operator.\n\nThe use of central controllers is prohibited. Each repository functions as an independent, self-contained unit. While all repositories must adhere to established Enterprise/Organization guidelines, standards, and structures, they remain independent and isolated from one another.\n\nUtilize \"ultrabrain\" (collective/expert-level problem-solving), cross-reviews (reserved for complex cases that warrant such an approach), and official documentation.\n\nYou are required to use native solutions and APIs from GitHub, Google, or Android (as applicable), or those from third-party providers approved by these platforms. Custom solutions should be used only as a last resort.\n\nWithin the scope of this work, ensure that all GitHub Projects, Discussions, and Issues—as well as Linear’s Issues, Projects, Teams, Initiatives, Cycles, and Milestones, and Entire’s Trails, Dispatches, Checkouts, and Memorys—are kept up to date, linked, cross-referenced, and synchronized. This includes ensuring the accuracy of statuses, priorities, assignees, labels, and content across all items whenever updates, links, cross-references, or synchronization are required.","reason":"Condição não satisfeita. Itens 'pendentes' ainda sem prova conclusiva: (1) a compra pelo canal Play permanece sem resposta do operador sobre a existência de conta de testador de licença/aparelho com Play Store, e o emulador pixel_10_api37 tem 'PlayStore.enabled=no'; (2) a leitura de 'Conteúdo do app' (IARC, público-alvo, categoria) é afirmada como só do Console com base na lista da API, sem consulta formal ao operador sobre alternativas; (3) o diretório 'github-operations\\temp\\op-terminal' é classificado como pré-existente e necessário, mas a exigência de que 'temp\\' seja apagado após a conclusão não foi cumprida nem justificada por consulta ao operador; (4) 'Lançamento' e 'Iniciar o lançamento' dependem de decisão do operador no Console, não de pesquisa registrada na pauta."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1ab85df5-54c5-4e54-8690-e594aed94c50","timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:55:29.896Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glistening-tumbling-prism"}
