 content across all items whenever updates, links, cross-references, or synchronization are required.","reason":"Not satisfied. Items still labeled as pending lack conclusive evidence of impossibility: (a) the Play purchase: no documented search of official alternatives, e.g. a license-tester account or a device with Play Store, was recorded; the emulator pixel_10_api37 has PlayStore.enabled=no; (b) Console content (IARC, target audience, category): the API inventory was printed, but no documented search for alternatives was recorded; (c) the 100% rollout was decided by the operator but not executed, and there is no proof of publication. The last message also says 'nothing pending', which conflicts with the pending list in LCV-464. The rule to delete temp\\ was replaced by an exception without proof that the state directory cannot be moved. Evidence that materials were saved before removal is partial: the one-off scripts were not uploaded to GitHub or Linear."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1030f3fd-8bef-4930-be3a-2fd8b9996e98","timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:03:03.837Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"c:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glistening-tumbling-prism"}
