 content across all items whenever updates, links, cross-references, or synchronization are required.","reason":"Not satisfied. Pending items remain without conclusive proof of impossibility: (1) Play purchase: the operator has not decided whether another test account exists; the Play Store emulator option was only listed, never tested. (2) Console content (IARC, target audience, category): the alternatives research is based on the API list and docs, with no formal consultation of the operator recorded. (3) Release 1.0.0 (21) publication: the last verified read (04:03 on 30/10/2026) is RELEASE_LIFECYCLE_STATE_NOT_SENT_FOR_REVIEW, with no evidence of PUBLISHED. (4) github-operations\\temp\\op-terminal was kept as an exception without proof it cannot be moved. (5) The one-off scripts were not uploaded to GitHub or Linear."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"3a15312b-8994-4a51-a7e2-2c7b84db6f2b","timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:04:32.708Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glistening-tumbling-prism"}
