 content across all items whenever updates, links, cross-references, or synchronization are required.","reason":"Not satisfied. The transcript still has items labeled pending that lack conclusive proof of impossibility: (1) the Play purchase, where android-36 google_apis_playstore was only listed and never tested and the operator has not decided about another test account; (2) Console content (IARC, target audience, category), treated as Console-only without a formal consultation of the operator on alternatives; (3) release 1.0.0 (21), with no PUBLISHED read, the last proven read being RELEASE_LIFECYCLE_STATE_IN_REVIEW at 04:05:53 on 30/10/2026; (4) github-operations\\temp\\op-terminal kept as an exception without proof it cannot be moved; (5) the one-off scripts were not uploaded to GitHub or Linear. Proven: PR #170 merged at f93e880, executions 41015253231 and 41015256076 succeeded, revisions astrologo-paid-00072-juv and astrologo-paid-internal-00059-juy at 100%."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"36ff0bb5-4964-45f5-8f35-f6100e19b444","timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:07:00.129Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lcvle\\lcv-workspace","sessionId":"3815f8b0-8c60-4890-93a0-2fcc4c634f88","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"glistening-tumbling-prism"}
