trologo): configure runtime AI models, modes and reasoning\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/admin-app/pull/772\"},{\"id\":\"c97be324-5219-4f19-9e57-4e975a9fd256\",\"title\":\"fix: preserve backend rollback and finish Guava lint constraints\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android/pull/157\"},{\"id\":\"9ab1ec3a-6df6-4c14-8d89-fde5eceddf18\",\"title\":\"Correção comprovada do rollback Cloud Run — pronta para commit\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://uploads.linear.app/223ca7d5-724d-4481-bf38-a3aa90fa50d4/22962547-2c16-4af2-859f-2a7cab927209/9edc07c0-1c0a-4156-9255-ed8c7e0810c3?REDACTED\"},{\"id\":\"f2e7a40f-983a-4b4a-8381-ab168d5cca6a\",\"title\":\"fix: stabilize paid backend and refund notifications (0.3.15)\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-android/pull/155\"},{\"id\":\"187001b5-3ca6-4861-8213-41054bdf5c32\",\"title\":\"Comprovante de reembolso: testes e renderização — 28/10/2026\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://uploads.linear.app/223ca7d5-724d-4481-bf38-a3aa90fa50d4/24519a85-9d6f-4417-a1ca-4da1e683e748/9d866e58-3e2a-40f2-a231-51e71269e1e9?REDACTED\"},{\"id\":\"0e9baed4-ef36-4ae1-9671-528f8278578e\",\"title\":\"fix(checkout): dados do comprador e qualidade Mercado Pago — v02.27.04 (#528)\",\"subtitle\":\"main\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/LCV-Ideas-Software/astrologo-app/commit/f40b8727e3b5c4113857b245eeca4f2936c37b56\"},{\"id\":\"e156f90a-4aac-482d-8863-1cd8b34d0108\",\"title\":\"Qualidade Mercado Pago — relatório do operador, 27/10/2026 19h22\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://uploads.linear.app/223ca7d5-724d-4481-bf38-a3aa90fa50d4/0ecd5ba1-7a1a-4f81-8851-593cb4f9c1fc/a5ec141c-976f-4f74-9c9f-a2e069e7652f?REDACTED\"},{\"id\":\"8f132ae3-5ad0-4c04-92ad-77f69232387a\",\"title\":\"Runtime corrigido em produção — 27/10/2026\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://uploads.linear.app/223ca7d5-724d-4481-bf38-a3aa90fa50d4/f6479465-eaad-4829-8