{"parentUuid":"8d5ddb07-92dc-438c-b8b9-bc28257f3380","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"110dcd88-4da4-456d-b567-dca3461d0c76","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xz7k738GW3h6pw4zjjMkFt","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"e7c3a93e-324f-4069-81c3-f9e01645a5a8\",\"body\":\"**Concluída em 30/10/2026** (ordem do operador: \\\"pode encerrar\\\").\\n\\nEvidência: constraint `io.opentelemetry:opentelemetry-api:1.67.0` em `backend/build.gradle.kts:67` na `main` `f93e880`; `gradlew :backend:dependencyInsight --dependency io.opentelemetry:opentelemetry-api --configuration runtimeClasspath` → `1.67.0 (by constraint)`, `1.62.0 -> 1.67.0`; alerta Dependabot #26 em estado `fixed`; imagens em produção (`astrologo-paid@sha256:b830f797…`, `astrologo-paid-runner@sha256:56eb73f5…`, revisões 00072-juv e internal-00059-juy a 100%) com 0 ocorrências na Artifact Analysis.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:36:22.782Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:36:22.743Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"b0bc73dd-2fff-4274-a700-f409577ae553\",\"name\":\"Leonardo Cardozo Vargas (LCV Ideas & Software)\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}"}]}]},"uuid":"01e7606d-2860-427e-ae35-2be943fbaa9a","timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:36:23.305Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"e7c3a93e-324f-4069-81c3-f9e01645a5a8\",\"body\":\"**Concluída em 30/10/2026** (ordem do operador: \\\"pode encerrar\\\").\\n\\nEvidência: constraint `io.opentelemetry:opentelemetry-api:1.67.0` em `backend/build.gradle.kts:67` na `main` `f93e880`; `gradlew :backend:dependencyInsight --dependency io.opentelemetry:opentelemetry-api --configuration runtimeClasspath` → `1.67.0 (by constraint)`, `1.62.0 -> 1.67.0`; alerta Dependabot #26 em estado `fixed`; imagens em produção (`astrologo-paid@sha256:b830f797…`, `astrologo-paid-runner@sha256:56eb73f5…`, revisões 00072-juv e internal-00059-juy a 100%) com 0 ocorrências na Artif